owing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yann-b-b","id":103848532,"login":"Yann-b-b","node_id":"U_kgDOBjCaVA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yann-b-b/Snoring_Detection_APP/commits/e5e6385f894aa31a46cc57bade28694f3468731b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:09:57Z","email":"ybaglinbunod@gmail.com","name":"Yann B-B"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:09:57Z","email":"ybaglinbunod@gmail.com","name":"Yann B-B"},"message":"Bundle optional INT8 model behind USE_INT8_MODEL flag (off)\n\nAdd the source repo''s INT8 export (deployment/conv_micro/conv_model.tflite,\n244,160 B vs 954,776 B float, 90.7% reported) as assets/conv_int8_model.tflite.\nA SnoreClassifier interface now fronts both models: the default float path\nkeeps the generated ConvFloatModel binding; the INT8 path loads a TFLite\nInterpreter and quantizes input / dequantizes output using each tensor''s\nscale and zero point (UINT8 or INT8). USE_INT8_MODEL stays false, so\nbehavior is unchanged. Document sizes in the README.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WycuSsi89kGYLb8NWAKK7e","tree":{"sha":"b75accf28b55b49468221b429584f529187dae36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yann-b-b/Snoring_Detection_APP/git/trees/b75accf28b55b49468221b429584f529187dae36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yann-b-b/Snoring_Detection_APP/git/commits/e5e6385f894aa31a46