g{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yann-b-b","id":103848532,"login":"Yann-b-b","node_id":"U_kgDOBjCaVA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yann-b-b/Snoring_Detection_APP/commits/4b6392cdf754f2112cbc05e210c864921de5c051/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:09:56Z","email":"ybaglinbunod@gmail.com","name":"Yann B-B"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:09:56Z","email":"ybaglinbunod@gmail.com","name":"Yann B-B"},"message":"Add MicroFrontend feature-parity regression test\n\nJVM unit test feeds a deterministic synthetic 1 s clip (120 Hz sawtooth\n+ fixed-seed Gaussian noise) to MicroFrontend.compute and asserts the\n1,960-float output matches a checked-in reference within 1e-3. The\nreference was generated by running the current implementation once\n(MicroFrontendReferenceGenerator, env-guarded) — it pins current\nbehavior, not TF-op ground truth. Singleton noise/PCAN state is reset\nvia reflection so results are order-independent. Enable\nunitTests.isReturnDefaultValues for the android.util.Log call.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WycuSsi89kGYLb8NWAKK7e","tree":{"sha":"16e386b5cf56b2b3a0306d37bceb3b9a71bf4cbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yann-b-b/Snoring_Detection_APP/git/trees/16e386b5cf56b2b3a0306d37bceb3b9a71bf4cbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yann-b-b/Snoring_Detection_APP/git/commits/4b6