nn-b-b/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yann-b-b","id":103848532,"login":"Yann-b-b","node_id":"U_kgDOBjCaVA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yann-b-b","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yann-b-b/Snoring_Detection_APP/commits/d706b3399c8cb89926ca12c0c2829a099bdf7402/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:09:56Z","email":"ybaglinbunod@gmail.com","name":"Yann B-B"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:09:56Z","email":"ybaglinbunod@gmail.com","name":"Yann B-B"},"message":"Fix incorrect label comment and correct README feature description\n\nThe old comment claimed 4 output labels; the model outputs [1,2] softmax\n[snoring, not_snoring]. The README called the frontend \"MFCC\"; it is the\nTF micro-frontend (log-mel + noise reduction + PCAN, 49x40). Add Model\nsection crediting adrianagaler/Snoring-Detection (speech_commands conv\narchitecture, Khan snoring dataset, 90.7% reported for the INT8 export,\nfloat export shipped) and a How-it-works section (1 s window, 100 ms\nhop, median-of-5 > 0.6 rule, on-device only).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WycuSsi89kGYLb8NWAKK7e","tree":{"sha":"33501f7169e65c08caa87cbd2c1f394f224b875a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yann-b-b/Snoring_Detection_APP/git/trees/33501f7169e65c08caa87cbd2c1f394f224b875a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yann-b-b/Snoring_Detection_APP/git/commits/d706b3399c8cb89926ca12c0