te":"2025-09-17T16:00:00Z","email":"btferus@gmail.com","name":"Brian Ferus"},"message":"Revamp theme system with purple focus and 14 theme options\n\nAdd 7 new purple-focused themes and update existing themes:\n\nNew Purple Themes:\n- Purple: Classic purple theme (new default)\n- Deep Purple: Rich, intense purple with strong glows\n- Midnight: Dark purple/indigo blend with dramatic effects\n- Lavender: Light purple theme (purple-tinted light mode)\n- Cyberpunk: Purple + cyan neon aesthetic\n- Royal: Purple + gold luxury theme\n- Neon: Magenta purple neon lights\n\nUpdated Existing Themes:\n- Dark: Now uses purple accents instead of blue\n- Light: Updated to purple primary colors\n- Neon: Converted to purple-based neon\n- Ocean: Added purple hints to blue theme\n\nPreserved Themes:\n- Sunset: Orange/pink warm theme\n- Forest: Green nature theme\n- Cherry Blossom: Pink theme (new)\n- Matrix: Green code aesthetic (new)\n\nAll themes include custom shadows, glows, and visual effects for unique experiences.","tree":{"sha":"06e1e45109bcff779ea5271ce79e378dc372b8f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferusb/ResumeWebsite/git/trees/06e1e45109bcff779ea5271ce79e378dc372b8f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferusb/ResumeWebsite/git/commits/c82420d7dcabe25bd0d9c42fabd588ddb9441097","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237360597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferusb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferusb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferusb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferusb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ferusb","id":237360597,"login":"ferusb","node_id":"U_kgDODiXV1Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferusb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferusb/recei