 test coverage, 100+ apps\n- 8 major projects with expandable details:\n  * GraphQL aggregation layer (100+ data types, 400+ deprecated endpoints)\n  * Enterprise React/TypeScript components (30+ business categories)\n  * Testing infrastructure (70% faster runtime, 50% less flake)\n  * CI/CD and debugging tools (400+ production issues resolved)\n  * File transporter service (7,000+ daily users)\n  * React component library (adopted by 100+ apps)\n  * Apollo GraphQL migration (50,000+ lines eliminated)\n  * UX observability and analytics\n- Skills grid: Frontend, Backend, DevOps, Leadership\n- Interactive expandable project cards with achievements and business impact\n- Fully responsive with Framer Motion animations","tree":{"sha":"b1f06aed7fb8e53d5aa26527f2ed2e27d207b87e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferusb/ResumeWebsite/git/trees/b1f06aed7fb8e53d5aa26527f2ed2e27d207b87e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ferusb/ResumeWebsite/git/commits/bb4763735892116f17a4052304414840e5bc7e8b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/237360597?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferusb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferusb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferusb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferusb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ferusb","id":237360597,"login":"ferusb","node_id":"U_kgDODiXV1Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferusb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferusb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferusb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferusb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferusb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ferusb","