Lu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoseLu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoseLu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BellisGit/btc-shopflow-monorepo/commits/d15835ed0ee06d486684b1250ab2a5fa2098ab9a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-07T05:33:54Z","email":"1208136885@qq.com","name":"BellisGit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-07T05:33:54Z","email":"1208136885@qq.com","name":"BellisGit"},"message":"chore: 发布 v1.0.7 版本\n\n✨ 主要更新:\n- 存储系统重构: 引入 pinia-plugin-persistedstate，统一管理所有 Store 持久化\n- 存储工具重组: 统一到 utils/storage/ 目录，新增 SessionStorage 和 IndexedDB 工具\n- 重构所有 Store: 移除手动持久化逻辑，使用插件自动管理\n- 新增 IndexedDB 工具: 基于 Dexie.js，支持大容量历史数据查询（可视化看板场景）\n- 创建完整文档: Cookie、SessionStorage、IndexedDB 使用文档\n\n🐛 Bug 修复:\n- 修复应用切换和路由渲染问题\n- 修复子应用 loading 不停止问题\n- 修复生产环境子应用内容挂载失败问题\n- 修复 Jenkins 构建配置问题\n\n🚀 功能增强:\n- 为所有子应用添加 keep-alive 路由持久化\n- 优化 Jenkins 构建配置，支持并行部署\n- 添加 CDN 加速参数支持\n\n详细更新说明请查看 CHANGELOG_v1.0.7.md","tree":{"sha":"d84387a4c74b3a18cf10c818d4d5bd4cd9ce5af2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BellisGit/btc-shopflow-monorepo/git/trees/d84387a4c74b3a18cf10c818d4d5bd4cd9ce5af2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BellisGit/btc-shopflow-monorepo/git/commits/d15835ed0ee06d486684b1250ab2a5fa2098ab9a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134040556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoseLu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoseLu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoseLu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoseLu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MoseLu","id":134040556,"login":"MoseLu","node_id":"U_kgDOB_1L7A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MoseLu/orgs","received_events_url