"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287896?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stevei101","id":287896,"login":"stevei101","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Nzg5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/commits/c9b653ead57eee7a570a5efc78b2678da32a5808/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-21T13:53:32Z","email":"stevei101@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Steven Irvin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-21T13:53:32Z","email":"stevei101@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Steven Irvin"},"message":"Fixed the Dockerfile to copy the README.md file before building the package\n\nFixed the Dockerfile to copy the README.md file before building the package.\nWhat Was Wrong\nThe Dockerfile was copying:\n✅ pyproject.toml\n✅ src/ directory\n❌ Missing: README.md\nBut pyproject.toml references readme = \"README.md\", so when hatchling tried to build the package, it couldn''t find the README file.\nWhat I Fixed\nAdded COPY README.md ./ to the Dockerfile on line 22, right after copying pyproject.toml and before the build step.","tree":{"sha":"b6cc6d5f0c805847760352e1a7e765a75b4287d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/git/trees/b6cc6d5f0c805847760352e1a7e765a75b4287d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/git/commits/c9b653ead57eee7a570a5efc78b2678da32a5808","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287896?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stevei101","id":287896,"login":"stevei101","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Nzg5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stevei101/hack-a-product/commit/c9b653ead57eee7a570a5efc78b2678da32a5808","node_id":"C_kwDOQGCY_NoAKGM5YjY1M2VhZDU3ZWVlN2E1NzBhNWVmYzc4YjI2NzhkYTMyYTU4MDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stevei101/hack-a-product/commit/9fa4186091ae2d4a8b95e68e4f75ae35e62194a7","sha":"9fa4186091ae2d4a8b95e68e4f75ae35e62194a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/commits/9fa4186091ae2d4a8b95e68e4f75ae35e62194a7"}],"sha":"c9b653ead57eee7a570a5efc78b2678da32a5808","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/commits/c9b653ead57eee7a570a5efc78b2678da32a5808"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287896?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stevei101","id":287896,"login":"stevei101","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Nzg5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/commits/9fa4186091ae2d4a8b95e68e4f75ae35e62194a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-21T13:48:25Z","email":"stevei101@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Steven Irvin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-21T13:48:25Z","email":"stevei101@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Steven Irvin"},"message":"Fixed Issues\n\nFixed Issues\n1. Backend Build Error - Missing README.md\nProblem: The pyproject.toml referenced readme = \"README.md\" but the file didn''t exist in the backend directory.\nFix: Created /backend/README.md with basic documentation about the backend application.\n2. CloudFront Invalidation Error\nProblem: The query was looking for the distribution using the S3 domain name product-mindset-dev-static.s3.amazonaws.com, but CloudFront uses the regional domain name like product-mindset-dev-static.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com.\nFix: Updated the query to use the CloudFront Comment field instead, which contains \"S3 bucket distribution for product-mindset-dev-static\". This is more reliable and matches what Terraform creates.\nThe updated query:\nAlso added error handling to fail gracefully if the distribution isn''t found.","tree":{"sha":"612c33ce1d40b3508c8313630c00eb8fe1db66d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/git/trees/612c33ce1d40b3508c8313630c00eb8fe1db66d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/git/commits/9fa4186091ae2d4a8b95e68e4f75ae35e62194a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287896?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stevei101","id":287896,"login":"stevei101","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Nzg5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stevei101/hack-a-product/commit/9fa4186091ae2d4a8b95e68e4f75ae35e62194a7","node_id":"C_kwDOQGCY_NoAKDlmYTQxODYwOTFhZTJkNGE4Yjk1ZTY4ZTRmNzVhZTM1ZTYyMTk0YTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stevei101/hack-a-product/commit/2f4bb158f1231308332a4b0a7a213ecd54e592f3","sha":"2f4bb158f1231308332a4b0a7a213ecd54e592f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/commits/2f4bb158f1231308332a4b0a7a213ecd54e592f3"}],"sha":"9fa4186091ae2d4a8b95e68e4f75ae35e62194a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/commits/9fa4186091ae2d4a8b95e68e4f75ae35e62194a7"},{"author":{"avatar