nfiguration\n\n✅ Fixed Configuration\n1. Terraform Cloud Block (terraform/main.tf)\nChanged from:\nTo:\n2. Workflow Updates (.github/workflows/deploy.yml)\n❌ Removed TF_WORKSPACE environment variable (not needed when workspace is in config)\n✅ Changed terraform plan -out=tfplan → terraform plan -input=false (simpler, like your reference)\n✅ Changed terraform apply -auto-approve tfplan → terraform apply -auto-approve -input=false (simpler)\nKey Differences Explained\nTags vs Name Strategy:\ntags: For multiple workspaces (e.g., product-mindset-dev, product-mindset-prod)\nRequires TF_WORKSPACE env var to select which one to use\nMore complex, for organizations with many environments\nname: For a single workspace (your case)\nSimpler, workspace is hardcoded in the Terraform config\nNo need for TF_WORKSPACE env var\nMatches your reference workflow pattern\nYour setup now matches the simpler pattern from your reference project! The workflow will now successfully initialize Terraform Cloud and use the hack-a-product workspace. 🎯","tree":{"sha":"d994284d2c38036fdeec90aceb0e541ab83562fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/git/trees/d994284d2c38036fdeec90aceb0e541ab83562fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/git/commits/68a91c64af409f3c13761d93ba4969a2068d827f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287896?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stevei101","id":287896,"login":"stevei101","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Nzg5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/orgs","received_eve