jM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stevei101/hack-a-product/commit/f7c7972a33c9161277ca24531fcb24bc21dce304","sha":"f7c7972a33c9161277ca24531fcb24bc21dce304","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/commits/f7c7972a33c9161277ca24531fcb24bc21dce304"}],"sha":"e517ba3d56e4f39601f05bbcfaa011607e08fc3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/commits/e517ba3d56e4f39601f05bbcfaa011607e08fc3a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287896?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stevei101","id":287896,"login":"stevei101","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4Nzg5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/commits/f7c7972a33c9161277ca24531fcb24bc21dce304/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-21T12:56:08Z","email":"stevei101@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Steven Irvin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-21T12:56:08Z","email":"stevei101@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Steven Irvin"},"message":"Summary of Changes to Fix AWS Provider Configuration Error\n\nSummary of Changes to Fix AWS Provider Configuration Error\nThe error occurred because the infrastructure job was trying to run Terraform without AWS credentials and without a proper AWS provider configuration. I''ve made the following changes:\n1. Added AWS Credentials to Infrastructure Job (.github/workflows/deploy.yml)\nAdded permissions block with id-token: write and contents: read to enable OIDC authentication\nAdded \"Configure AWS credentials\" step before Terraform setup to authenticate with AWS using the GitHub OIDC provider\n2. Added AWS Provider Block (terraform/main.tf)\nAdded explicit provider \"aws\" configuration block with the region setting\nThis satisfies Terraform''s requirement for explicit provider configuration\n3. Added AWS Region Variable (.github/workflows/deploy.yml)\nAdded TF_VAR_aws_region to all Terraform steps (Init, Validate, Plan)\nThis ensures the provider can use the correct AWS region\nWhy These Changes Fix the Error:\nAuthentication: The workflow now authenticates with AWS using OIDC before running Terraform commands\nProvider Configuration: Terraform now has an explicit AWS provider block as required\nComplete Variables: All required variables are now properly passed to Terraform\nThe workflow will now:\nAuthenticate with AWS using the role specified in AWS_ROLE_ARN secret\nInitialize Terraform with proper AWS credentials\nValidate and plan the infrastructure changes successfully","tree":{"sha":"51a2520a9f23294ac14b3912742390e4643c6dde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/git/trees/51a2520a9f23294ac14b3912742390e4643c6dde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stevei101/hack-a-product/git/commits/f7c7972a33c9161277ca24531fcb24bc21dce304","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/287896?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stevei101/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://ap