 it:\n- config.bnfMcpUrl        -> https://bnf.mcp.alien.club/mcp\n- config.dataclusterMcpUrl -> https://mcp-bnf-corpus-demo-1784645041754.mcp.alien.club/mcp\n- worker.config.backendApiUrl -> https://api.alien.club\n- worker.config.clusterId  -> 113\n\nAlso fixes the maintenance nginx to expose a 200 /healthz (the page itself\nreturns 503 by design, which the k8s readiness probe treated as failure).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31d0a7ddb506086d67aaa5a5bdc61390e04cfd1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/31d0a7ddb506086d67aaa5a5bdc61390e04cfd1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/68494a5c6036f451e247e873f96b60704580834a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/68494a5c6036f451e247e873f96b60704580834a","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDY4NDk0YTVjNjAzNmY0NTFlMjQ3ZTg3M2Y5NmI2MDcwNDU4MDgzNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/c575fb8d7c36a29d1ccdca5fb8917748a9b5eb9d","sha":"c575fb8d7c36a29d1ccdca5fb8917748a9b5eb9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/c575fb8d7c36a29d1ccdca5fb8917748a9b5eb9d"}],"sha":"68494a5c6036f451e247e873f96b60704580834a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/68494a5c6036f451e247e873f96b60704580834a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1092155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xqua/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xqua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xqua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Xqua/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Xqua","id":1092155,"login":"Xqua","