32c9a58de897"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/603a6df911a21d9275e90782246d0de4cd54cbf8","sha":"603a6df911a21d9275e90782246d0de4cd54cbf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/603a6df911a21d9275e90782246d0de4cd54cbf8"}],"sha":"c575fb8d7c36a29d1ccdca5fb8917748a9b5eb9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/c575fb8d7c36a29d1ccdca5fb8917748a9b5eb9d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/603a6df911a21d9275e90782246d0de4cd54cbf8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T08:03:00Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T08:03:00Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): add prod-data migration backfill + maintenance assets\n\nMigrate the BnF demo RAG data off the alpha data plane (cluster 158) onto the\nprod tenant (cluster 113) by re-registering the worker''s S3 artifact backup —\nno re-OCR / re-embed. Validated end-to-end: 9,914 docs / 25 datasets, prod\nentry counts match dev exactly, live vector search returns ARK+folio.\n\n- worker-v2/scripts/backfill-prod.ts: idempotent, resumable, delta-aware\n  driver. Reuses assembleMarkdown/buildIndexChunks/ClusterHttp/S3BlobStore.\n  Manifest = dev catalog ∩ app project ids; per-dataset existing-entry preload\n  (avoids O(n^2) find); V2 (v2/ prefix) primary + V1 (projects/ layout) fallback.\n- worker-v2/scripts/validate-migration.ts: per-dataset dev↔prod entry_count\n  diff + live vector-search RAG proof.\n- helm/maintenance/: bilingual FR/EN maintenance page (503) + nginx manifest +\n  on/off scripts that flip the VirtualService during cutover.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e7d4f294d780217e1cd6a295b5f60175576f31b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/e7d4f294d780217e1cd6a295b5f60175576f31b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/603a6df911a21d9275e90782246d0de4cd54cbf8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/603a6df911a21d9275e90782246d0de4cd54cbf8","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDYwM2E2ZGY5MTFhMjFkOTI3NWU5MDc4MjI0NmQwZGU0Y2Q1NGNiZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/3b2080747a20494be6f8d64ee3ad32c9a58de897","sha":"3b2080747a20494be6f8d64ee3ad32c9a58de897","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/3b2080747a20494be6f8d64ee3ad32c9a58de897"}],"sha":"603a6df911a21d9275e90782246d0de4cd54cbf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/603a6df911a21d9275e90782246d0de4cd54cbf8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71235233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoratoni","id":71235233,"login":"yoratoni","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjM1MjMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/3b2080747a20494be6f8d64ee3ad32c9a58de897/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T13:50:29Z","email":"yoratoni.dev@gmail.com","name":"yoratoni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T13:50:29Z","email":"yoratoni.dev@gmail.com","name":"yoratoni"},"message":"fix(bnf): reconcile chart image tags up to live prod (app 0.11.0, worker 0.10.1)\n\nvalues.yaml recorded app=0.10.0 / worker=0.10.0 but prod runs app=0.11.0 /\nworker=0.10.1 — those images were deployed out-of-band and the tag bumps never\nlanded on main. A plain `helm upgrade` from the chart would therefore have\nDOWNGRADED the app and worker. Bump the recorded tags to match what''s live so\ndeploying 0.12.0 is a no-op on the app/worker images and only rolls the broker\n(2Gi) + worker configmap. appVersion 0.10.0→0.11.0 to track the app image.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77e0a066d644d7055d3a887c3fe68ee3aae05915","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/77e0a066d644d7055d3a887c3fe68ee3aae05915"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/3b2080747a20494be6f8d64ee3ad32c9a58de897","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71235233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoratoni","id":71235233,"login":"yoratoni","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjM1MjMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/3b2080747a20494be6f8d64ee3ad32c9a58de897","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDNiMjA4MDc0N2EyMDQ5NGJlNmY4ZDY0ZWUzYWQzMmM5YTU4ZGU4OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/8ad73279bcf02adbb9d91f0b30969b3e8c3b15bd","sha":"8ad73279bcf02adbb9d91f0b30969b3e8c3b15bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/8ad73279bcf02adbb9d91f0b30969b3e8c3b15bd"}],"sha":"3b2080747a20494be6f8d64ee3ad32c9a58de897","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/3b2080747a20494be6f8d64ee3ad32c9a58de897"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71235233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoratoni","id":71235233,"login":"yoratoni","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjM1MjMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/8ad73279bcf02adbb9d91f0b30969b3e8c3b15bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T12:31:44Z","email":"yoratoni.dev@gmail.com","name":"yoratoni"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T12:31:44Z","email":"yoratoni.dev@gmail.com","name":"yoratoni"},"message":"fix(bnf): broker memory 256Mi→2Gi + chart cleanup (0.12.0, chart-only)\n\nThe broker buffers each upstream response body whole before mirroring it\n(server.ts `Buffer.from(await upstream.arrayBuffer())`), so at worker\nbnfFetchConcurrency=128 × ~10MB full-res folio images it held >1GB and got\nOOMKilled. The single-replica broker going down dropped every in-flight BnF\nfetch with ECONNREFUSED — the root cause of the mass \"all ingestions failed\"\nincident. Bump the broker limit 256Mi→2Gi (request 96Mi→512Mi).\n\nCleanup while here:\n- Drop dead BNF_ALTO_CONCURRENCY / bnfAltoConcurrency (set by the chart,\n  read by nothing in worker-v2).\n- De-stale the bnfFetchConcurrency and workerConcurrency comments (they still\n  described the pre-1000/min, 12-wide regime; rewritten regime-agnostic).\n\nChart-only, no image change; configmap checksum + broker resource change roll\nthe pods on the next helm upgrade. Version jumps 0.10.0→0.12.0 (0.11.0 was\ndeployed out-of-band and never landed on main).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fbe4fb020c2d9cdf622517a9195c09be17b8100a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/fbe4fb020c2d9cdf622517a9195c09be17b8100a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/8ad73279bcf02adbb9d91f0b30969b3e8c3b15bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71235233?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yoratoni","id":71235233,"login":"yoratoni","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjM1MjMz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yoratoni","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/8ad73279bcf02adbb9d91f0b30969b3e8c3b15bd","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDhhZDczMjc5YmNmMDJhZGJiOWQ5MWYwYjMwOTY5YjNlOGMzYjE1YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/ec01f1ef2d300302382fa58ce2a745b28c1672cd","sha":"ec01f1ef2d300302382fa58ce2a745b28c1672cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/ec01f1ef2d300302382fa58ce2a745b28c1672cd"}],"sha":"8ad73279bcf02adbb9d91f0b30969b3e8c3b15bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/8ad73279bcf02adbb9d91f0b30969b3e8c3b15bd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/ec01f1ef2d300302382fa58ce2a745b28c1672cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T21:46:37Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T21:46:37Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"wip","tree":{"sha":"6d80b5290cb7710f1da32ec0de16eee7b4b97864","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/6d80b5290cb7710f1da32ec0de16eee7b4b97864"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/ec01f1ef2d300302382fa58ce2a745b28c1672cd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/ec01f1ef2d300302382fa58ce2a745b28c1672cd","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGVjMDFmMWVmMmQzMDAzMDIzODJmYTU4Y2UyYTc0NWIyOGMxNjcyY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/e862165f1bcd6a14b04ce15d583b6d0bbc1b688b","sha":"e862165f1bcd6a14b04ce15d583b6d0bbc1b688b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/e862165f1bcd6a14b04ce15d583b6d0bbc1b688b"}],"sha":"ec01f1ef2d300302382fa58ce2a745b28c1672cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/ec01f1ef2d300302382fa58ce2a745b28c1672cd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/e862165f1bcd6a14b04ce15d583b6d0bbc1b688b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T15:21:13Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T15:21:13Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): run-scope the ingest progress read-model + \"folios ahead\" counter (0.10.0)\n\nWith two ingests running concurrently, job 2''s card showed job 1''s numbers: the\nper-stage bucket counts came from the SHARED pg-boss queues (global), while docs/\nfolios were already run-scoped. Every job payload carries its docJobId, so:\n\n- worker: buildProgress now counts each stage via queue.countsForDocs(name,\n  docJobIdsForRun(runId)) — only the run''s own jobs (cheap: only the active/created/\n  retry states, which pg-boss indexes). New DocStateStore.docJobIdsForRun +\n  QueueClient.countsForDocs (pg + memory).\n- worker: new foliosAhead = global pending fetch − this run''s pending — the folios\n  from OTHER runs ahead in the shared rate-capped queue; folded into the ETA.\n- app: ClusterQueueProgress.foliosAhead (passthrough) + the card shows \"N devant\n  vous (autre traitement)\" on the fetch row. fr/en keys.\n\nThe no-runId status CLI keeps the global counts. App+worker → 0.10.0; broker stays 0.9.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b0f078242ca6c17bebe33590fead4dcd2811d3da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/b0f078242ca6c17bebe33590fead4dcd2811d3da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/e862165f1bcd6a14b04ce15d583b6d0bbc1b688b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/e862165f1bcd6a14b04ce15d583b6d0bbc1b688b","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGU4NjIxNjVmMWJjZDZhMTRiMDRjZTE1ZDU4M2I2ZDBiYmMxYjY4OGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/a91bbd9c257a391bb63f54107b3441e2efc9bdba","sha":"a91bbd9c257a391bb63f54107b3441e2efc9bdba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/a91bbd9c257a391bb63f54107b3441e2efc9bdba"}],"sha":"e862165f1bcd6a14b04ce15d583b6d0bbc1b688b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/e862165f1bcd6a14b04ce15d583b6d0bbc1b688b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/a91bbd9c257a391bb63f54107b3441e2efc9bdba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T14:58:07Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T14:58:07Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"perf(bnf): raise DESCRIBE_CONCURRENCY 16→32 (0.9.3, chart-only)\n\nOnce the sliding-window fetch fix put the fetch lane at ~981/min, the doc-level\ndescribe stage (16) became the bottleneck. Raise to 32 — OpenRouter has no per-key\nRPM cap, and total vision calls stay bounded by describeCallConcurrency (64) across\nall docs. No image change; the worker-config checksum rolls the worker. Live: helm\nrev 35, worker stays 0.9.2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"debc2532cd031a7384c5ce84ee823f03cbbfac01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/debc2532cd031a7384c5ce84ee823f03cbbfac01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/a91bbd9c257a391bb63f54107b3441e2efc9bdba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/a91bbd9c257a391bb63f54107b3441e2efc9bdba","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGE5MWJiZDljMjU3YTM5MWJiNjNmNTQxMDdiMzQ0MWUyZWZjOWJkYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/96b1423cd79c44b5b8312dcac990cb9c44fc5d5d","sha":"96b1423cd79c44b5b8312dcac990cb9c44fc5d5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/96b1423cd79c44b5b8312dcac990cb9c44fc5d5d"}],"sha":"a91bbd9c257a391bb63f54107b3441e2efc9bdba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/a91bbd9c257a391bb63f54107b3441e2efc9bdba"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/96b1423cd79c44b5b8312dcac990cb9c44fc5d5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T14:42:26Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T14:42:26Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(worker-v2): bound runaway image-describe + temp-bump retry (0.9.2)\n\ngemini-2.5-flash intermittently ran a degenerate generation to the token ceiling on\ndense folios → finish_reason=length → unparseable JSON → describe failures (~50 in a\nprod run). max_tokens 16384→8192 bounds the waste; a truncation/transient retry now\nraises temperature 0.3→0.8, which breaks the repetition loop (a lower temperature\nre-enters it). Full transcription prompt kept. Worker → 0.9.2 (app/broker stay 0.9.0).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"323e4102f5bffdab6034dd22d6640b82d28129a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/323e4102f5bffdab6034dd22d6640b82d28129a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/96b1423cd79c44b5b8312dcac990cb9c44fc5d5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/96b1423cd79c44b5b8312dcac990cb9c44fc5d5d","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDk2YjE0MjNjZDc5YzQ0YjViODMxMmRjYWM5OTBjYjljNDRmYzVkNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/b17500d5b65320fb544691bf02deb31c7c582c8d","sha":"b17500d5b65320fb544691bf02deb31c7c582c8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/b17500d5b65320fb544691bf02deb31c7c582c8d"}],"sha":"96b1423cd79c44b5b8312dcac990cb9c44fc5d5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/96b1423cd79c44b5b8312dcac990cb9c44fc5d5d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/b17500d5b65320fb544691bf02deb31c7c582c8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T14:26:33Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T14:26:33Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"perf(worker-v2): sliding-window pg-boss fetch + OpenRouter JSON mode (0.9.0/0.9.1)\n\nThe fetch lane held ~600/min against a 1000/min quota with the UI showing 128\n\"running\" while the broker saw only ~20 in flight at BnF. Root cause: the queue\nadapter used pg-boss''s BATCH handler (batchSize + Promise.all) — a barrier that\nmarks the whole batch active and won''t refill until the slowest job finishes, so\none straggler froze the other slots (far worse with the new 135s timeout).\n\n- queue-pgboss: replace the batch handler with a true sliding-window pool\n  (fetch the free capacity, run each job independently, complete/fail + refill the\n  one slot at once). active count now reflects TRUE in-flight; rate gate stays fed.\n- vision: gemini-2.5-flash returned unparseable JSON on real estampes (long\n  verbatim legendes break JSON syntax / truncate) → every describe fell back to raw\n  text. Add response_format json_object (constrains the decoder to valid JSON),\n  raise max_tokens 8192→16384, retry finish_reason=length, and a balanced-brace\n  JSON extractor as a cross-provider fallback.\n- chart/app: bump to 0.9.0; worker image to 0.9.1 (the vision patch).\n\nLive on platform-prod: app/broker 0.9.0, worker 0.9.1 (helm rev 33).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aed9b4f2be1701a52a6a49e41775132a0f13c88c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/aed9b4f2be1701a52a6a49e41775132a0f13c88c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/b17500d5b65320fb544691bf02deb31c7c582c8d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/b17500d5b65320fb544691bf02deb31c7c582c8d","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGIxNzUwMGQ1YjY1MzIwZmI1NDQ2OTFiZjAyZGViMzFjN2M1ODJjOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/359f31c917d96c36ae896918b416e13b2f8eda11","sha":"359f31c917d96c36ae896918b416e13b2f8eda11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/359f31c917d96c36ae896918b416e13b2f8eda11"}],"sha":"b17500d5b65320fb544691bf02deb31c7c582c8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/b17500d5b65320fb544691bf02deb31c7c582c8d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/359f31c917d96c36ae896918b416e13b2f8eda11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T14:06:14Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T14:06:14Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"lots of work","tree":{"sha":"fefb0eef43665517d4b7e5e21cc5c941d6628297","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/fefb0eef43665517d4b7e5e21cc5c941d6628297"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/359f31c917d96c36ae896918b416e13b2f8eda11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/359f31c917d96c36ae896918b416e13b2f8eda11","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDM1OWYzMWM5MTdkOTZjMzZhZTg5NjkxOGI0MTZlMTNiMmY4ZWRhMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/3ebb2b9c28d9242e0bd3dbc09569a3ef2d1d1f73","sha":"3ebb2b9c28d9242e0bd3dbc09569a3ef2d1d1f73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/3ebb2b9c28d9242e0bd3dbc09569a3ef2d1d1f73"}],"sha":"359f31c917d96c36ae896918b416e13b2f8eda11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/359f31c917d96c36ae896918b416e13b2f8eda11"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/3ebb2b9c28d9242e0bd3dbc09569a3ef2d1d1f73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T14:04:31Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T14:04:31Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(worker-v2): drop folio-less IIIF canvases that collide on ordre\n\nA \"document sonore\" (ark:/12148/bpt6k88175778) hung ingestion forever: its\nmanifest had 6 canvases but two were audio playback surfaces with no\n/f<N>/ folio id. parseV3Manifest fell back to 1-based position for those,\nassigning ordres 1,2 — colliding with the real image folios f1,f2. The\nfan-in counts distinct (docJobId, ordre) folios, so pagesExpected=6 could\nnever be reached (only 4 distinct folios), and the doc sat in `planned`\nforever, blocking the run from going terminal.\n\nparseV3Manifest now derives ordre strictly from /f<N>/ and, when any canvas\ncarries a folio id, drops the folio-less media canvases (the image fetch URL\nis folio-numbered, so a folio-less canvas is unfetchable regardless). Falls\nback to 1-based position only for a uniformly id-less legacy manifest, and\ndedupes by ordre as a final guard. Adds two regression tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbee2533d8610d800b6eb2519d99900ee5cd62f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/dbee2533d8610d800b6eb2519d99900ee5cd62f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/3ebb2b9c28d9242e0bd3dbc09569a3ef2d1d1f73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/3ebb2b9c28d9242e0bd3dbc09569a3ef2d1d1f73","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDNlYmIyYjljMjhkOTI0MmUwYmQzZGJjMDk1NjlhM2VmMmQxZDFmNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/03b86d84404daa514ed56d1e3bd63de49829b4df","sha":"03b86d84404daa514ed56d1e3bd63de49829b4df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/03b86d84404daa514ed56d1e3bd63de49829b4df"}],"sha":"3ebb2b9c28d9242e0bd3dbc09569a3ef2d1d1f73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/3ebb2b9c28d9242e0bd3dbc09569a3ef2d1d1f73"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/03b86d84404daa514ed56d1e3bd63de49829b4df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T12:49:28Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T12:49:28Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(bnf): refresh Ingérer counts when a job goes terminal\n\nThe delta panel, ingested-version label, and job history are server-rendered\nprops computed at page load, not live queries. While a job runs useIngestStatus\npolls, but the moment it goes terminal those props are stale: the job committed\n(Document.indexedAt advanced, the delta shrank) yet the panel still shows the\npre-ingest counts until a manual reload — a librarian who leaves the tab open\nsees no change and concludes ingestion failed.\n\nAdd an effect that calls router.refresh() once on the live→terminal transition,\nre-running the server component to pull fresh counts + history. router.refresh()\npreserves client state (active job id, dialogs, scroll). The guard ref is seeded\nfrom initialActiveJobId so the race where a job finishes between server render\nand the first poll is also covered.\n\nApp-only release: bump app image 0.8.0→0.8.1 (worker/broker unchanged).","tree":{"sha":"37ca33d8fedb07e6b4b18249b9f1cefafca4c019","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/37ca33d8fedb07e6b4b18249b9f1cefafca4c019"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/03b86d84404daa514ed56d1e3bd63de49829b4df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/03b86d84404daa514ed56d1e3bd63de49829b4df","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDAzYjg2ZDg0NDA0ZGFhNTE0ZWQ1NmQxZTNiZDYzZGU0OTgyOWI0ZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/53991299f477a54f286bdac9b18594e5d9f52d37","sha":"53991299f477a54f286bdac9b18594e5d9f52d37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/53991299f477a54f286bdac9b18594e5d9f52d37"}],"sha":"03b86d84404daa514ed56d1e3bd63de49829b4df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/03b86d84404daa514ed56d1e3bd63de49829b4df"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/53991299f477a54f286bdac9b18594e5d9f52d37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T12:48:05Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T12:48:05Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"chore(bnf): worker memory 6Gi→10Gi (provision generously, RAM is cheap)\n\nNodes have ~30Gi; over-provision so a full 255-doc run at bnfFetchConcurrency=128\nnever approaches the ceiling, rather than trimming concurrency to save RAM.\nlimit 6Gi→10Gi, request 1Gi→2Gi. Config-only, chart 0.8.3, deployed rev 30.","tree":{"sha":"a7170c49992f0ad174cd93b29a64ec023ed71d46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/a7170c49992f0ad174cd93b29a64ec023ed71d46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/53991299f477a54f286bdac9b18594e5d9f52d37","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/53991299f477a54f286bdac9b18594e5d9f52d37","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDUzOTkxMjk5ZjQ3N2E1NGYyODZiZGFjOWIxODU5NGU1ZDlmNTJkMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/48183acabc13bae3b42fc2db7e9668d1beb27b04","sha":"48183acabc13bae3b42fc2db7e9668d1beb27b04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/48183acabc13bae3b42fc2db7e9668d1beb27b04"}],"sha":"53991299f477a54f286bdac9b18594e5d9f52d37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/53991299f477a54f286bdac9b18594e5d9f52d37"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/48183acabc13bae3b42fc2db7e9668d1beb27b04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T12:39:34Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T12:39:34Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(bnf): raise worker memory 2Gi→6Gi — OOMKilled at bnfFetchConcurrency=128\n\nThe 0.8.1 jump to 1000 RPM / fetch concurrency 128 OOMKilled the prod worker\n(2Gi limit). At 128-wide fetch the stage holds up to 128 image Buffers at once —\nfull-res \"max\" cartes (Mistral lane) run ~10MB each — plus the vision lane''s\nbase64 describe buffers. Limit 2Gi→6Gi, request 512Mi→1Gi (nodes have ample\nheadroom). Config-only; chart 0.8.2, images unchanged. Deployed rev 29 —\nworker restarts=0 since.","tree":{"sha":"41e3c3dffbe042e3b5f40f5bb3af65c705638220","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/41e3c3dffbe042e3b5f40f5bb3af65c705638220"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/48183acabc13bae3b42fc2db7e9668d1beb27b04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/48183acabc13bae3b42fc2db7e9668d1beb27b04","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDQ4MTgzYWNhYmMxM2JhZTNiNDJmYzJkYjdlOTY2OGQxYmViMjdiMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/528fc1d56b09920a494c27671506e2eab952832d","sha":"528fc1d56b09920a494c27671506e2eab952832d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/528fc1d56b09920a494c27671506e2eab952832d"}],"sha":"48183acabc13bae3b42fc2db7e9668d1beb27b04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/48183acabc13bae3b42fc2db7e9668d1beb27b04"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/528fc1d56b09920a494c27671506e2eab952832d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T12:23:12Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T12:23:12Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"chore(release): 0.8.1 — worker-v2 vision fixes + 1000 RPM live on platform-prod\n\nReleased rev 28. Worker-only image bump (0.8.1); app + broker images unchanged\n(0.8.0), their pods restart only on configmap change.\n\nCode (already committed, now shipped): OpenRouter-primary vision chain + pair-level\nretry + 90s timeout, pct:33 vision downscale, the onExhausted run-completion guard\n(no doc can strand a run), and per-doc describe-folio parallelism (shared\nsemaphore). The worker-creds ExternalSecret now also pulls OPENROUTER_API_KEY.\n\nConfig (BnF raised the partner quota to 1000/min — Ludovic, 2026-06-26):\n- broker.config.globalRpm 300 → 1000\n- worker BNF_GLOBAL_RPM (new in the worker configmap) = 1000 so the worker''s own\n  rate gate matches the broker (else it self-throttles at the old 300 default)\n- worker.config.bnfFetchConcurrency 32 → 128 (sized to feed the 1000/min gate)\n- worker.config.maxOcrPages 300 → 1000\n\nVerified live: worker_v2_up fetchRatePerMin=1000 / fetch concurrency 128,\nOPENROUTER_API_KEY present in the worker, broker caps global=1000/min, broker\nOAuth 200, app 307 / auth 200.","tree":{"sha":"bbdc39705c9e660b17167f2d35ba82309de52a85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/bbdc39705c9e660b17167f2d35ba82309de52a85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/528fc1d56b09920a494c27671506e2eab952832d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/528fc1d56b09920a494c27671506e2eab952832d","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDUyOGZjMWQ1NmIwOTkyMGE0OTRjMjc2NzE1MDZlMmVhYjk1MjgzMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/31e2021684b3bb406b26ffa696710051a764266e","sha":"31e2021684b3bb406b26ffa696710051a764266e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/31e2021684b3bb406b26ffa696710051a764266e"}],"sha":"528fc1d56b09920a494c27671506e2eab952832d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/528fc1d56b09920a494c27671506e2eab952832d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/31e2021684b3bb406b26ffa696710051a764266e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T12:12:56Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T12:12:56Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"perf(worker-v2): parallelize describe folios within a doc (shared semaphore)\n\nThe describe (vision) stage processed a doc''s folios SEQUENTIALLY — a 30-folio\ndoc was 30 back-to-back OpenRouter calls (~15 min), while the stage''s other\nworker slots sat idle. Now each doc fans its folios out concurrently, bounded by\na single shared Semaphore (DESCRIBE_CALL_CONCURRENCY, default 24) so the TOTAL\nin-flight vision calls across all docs stay under OpenRouter''s rate/DDoS ceiling\n— a lone doc gets the full width (~40s), many docs share the same cap. Folio\norder is restored (sort by ordre) for citation accuracy; a failed folio is still\ndropped, not fatal.\n\nThis is the per-doc concurrency that was missing: fetch is per-folio (rate-gated),\nbut the back-half lanes receive a whole DocReady — describe now uses the width.\nNew Semaphore primitive (concurrency cap, distinct from RateLimiter''s rate cap)\n+ tests. 163 worker-v2 tests + tsc + eslint green.","tree":{"sha":"2d54301151edf7b7b380156dba18ca248a31c5b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/2d54301151edf7b7b380156dba18ca248a31c5b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/31e2021684b3bb406b26ffa696710051a764266e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/31e2021684b3bb406b26ffa696710051a764266e","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDMxZTIwMjE2ODRiM2JiNDA2YjI2ZmZhNjk2NzEwMDUxYTc2NDI2NmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/f8254a100e42525169d879eeafd3cf73226b10f5","sha":"f8254a100e42525169d879eeafd3cf73226b10f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/f8254a100e42525169d879eeafd3cf73226b10f5"}],"sha":"31e2021684b3bb406b26ffa696710051a764266e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/31e2021684b3bb406b26ffa696710051a764266e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/f8254a100e42525169d879eeafd3cf73226b10f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T12:02:25Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T12:02:25Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(worker-v2): requeue-stranded recovery CLI\n\nRe-sends a fresh DocReady (rebuilt from the persisted plan + landed folios) to the\nlane queue for docs the Monitor routed (status `ready`) but whose lane message\ndied and won''t redeliver — stranding them non-terminal so the run can''t complete.\n\n  node --import tsx src/requeue-stranded.ts <runId>\n\nUsed to recover 14 vision docs (30 folios each) whose describe messages went to\npg-boss `failed` during the Holo-outage + worker-restart churn, before the\nonExhausted guard landed. With the guard in place this is now a rare manual\nrecovery, not a routine need.","tree":{"sha":"84afaa892e870a8adfae3cbf37fa820fd51dc350","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/84afaa892e870a8adfae3cbf37fa820fd51dc350"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/f8254a100e42525169d879eeafd3cf73226b10f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/f8254a100e42525169d879eeafd3cf73226b10f5","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGY4MjU0YTEwMGU0MjUyNTE2OWQ4NzllZWFmZDNjZjczMjI2YjEwZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/8e411fdf742d7ca9847e12cb3c3e8e8e41a6cbde","sha":"8e411fdf742d7ca9847e12cb3c3e8e8e41a6cbde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/8e411fdf742d7ca9847e12cb3c3e8e8e41a6cbde"}],"sha":"f8254a100e42525169d879eeafd3cf73226b10f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/f8254a100e42525169d879eeafd3cf73226b10f5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/8e411fdf742d7ca9847e12cb3c3e8e8e41a6cbde/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T10:55:12Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T10:55:12Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(worker-v2): downscale vision images + run-completion safety net for stuck docs\n\nTwo real bugs found while the describe lane hung mid-run:\n\n1. Vision images were fetched at IIIF \"max\" (full native res). A single full-res\n   carte/estampe (~2.5 MB) takes ~31s on OpenRouter; sixteen concurrent blow the\n   60s timeout, so every describe call aborted → lane stalled. Vision only needs a\n   description, so the VISION lane now downscales (default pct:33 — the only\n   BnF-safe downscale; fixed w,h above native 400s). Mistral OCR keeps \"max\" for\n   dense text. Measured: pct:25 = 201 KB / 15s vs max = 2.5 MB / 31s. Per-lane in\n   fetch.ts (FolioItem.lane); VISION_IMAGE_SIZE overrides. OpenRouter timeout\n   60s→90s for gemma reasoning headroom.\n\n2. A lane stage that exhausted its retries left the doc in a non-terminal status\n   forever (the queue marked the message failed, but nothing marked the DOC), so\n   the run could never complete and the UI hung at \"N en cours\". register/fetch/\n   metadata/manifest already guarded this; the five back-half lane stages\n   (describe, assemble, embed, ocr-submit, ocr-poll) did not. Added a base-class\n   `onExhausted` hook fired on the final failed attempt; each lane overrides it to\n   mark its doc failed. Now an unrecoverable doc fails cleanly and the run still\n   completes (partial). +2 base tests.\n\n160 worker-v2 tests + tsc + eslint green. (Vision downscale only applies to\nfreshly-fetched folios; a run with images already cached at \"max\" must be\nre-ingested to benefit.)","tree":{"sha":"aea99646a74734273ea1ea1cfca3b4b4c8215f70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/aea99646a74734273ea1ea1cfca3b4b4c8215f70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/8e411fdf742d7ca9847e12cb3c3e8e8e41a6cbde","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/8e411fdf742d7ca9847e12cb3c3e8e8e41a6cbde","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDhlNDExZmRmNzQyZDdjYTk4NDdlMTJjYjNjM2U4ZThlNDFhNmNiZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/05bb2c54c9636556f2351df8c1d28c5b150036f6","sha":"05bb2c54c9636556f2351df8c1d28c5b150036f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/05bb2c54c9636556f2351df8c1d28c5b150036f6"}],"sha":"8e411fdf742d7ca9847e12cb3c3e8e8e41a6cbde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/8e411fdf742d7ca9847e12cb3c3e8e8e41a6cbde"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/05bb2c54c9636556f2351df8c1d28c5b150036f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T10:26:54Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T10:26:54Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(worker-v2): OpenRouter-primary vision chain + pair-level retry, fast Holo fail\n\nThe describe lane stalled hard: Scaleway Holo was timing out on every call, and\nthe old per-provider 3×retry meant 3×120s of dead Holo before the Gemini\nfallback — 16 workers frozen for minutes.\n\nTwo changes to the vendored vision client:\n\n- Retry is now at the PAIR/CHAIN level, not per-provider. Each round tries each\n  provider ONCE in order; on ANY error it falls straight to the next; it only\n  backs off + retries the whole chain (×3) if EVERY provider throws. A provider\n  that responds with unparseable JSON is \"good enough\" (caller uses raw text), so\n  it returns without looping. Holo''s per-call timeout dropped 120s → 30s, so a\n  dead Holo costs one short failed call, not minutes.\n- New PRIMARY provider: OpenRouter (OpenAI-compatible /chat/completions via raw\n  undici, no SDK/new dep), model google/gemma-4-31b-it (OPENROUTER_VISION_MODEL\n  overrides). Chain is now OpenRouter → Holo → Gemini. OpenRouter key is the same\n  OPENROUTER_API_KEY the app''s agent already uses. Verified live: describe lane\n  recovered (was 0 completions, now flowing), OpenRouter 200s, 0 HTTP errors.\n\n158 worker-v2 tests + tsc + eslint green.","tree":{"sha":"cbf3aed6db4ade078e0dd87a917332c0695d8f82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/cbf3aed6db4ade078e0dd87a917332c0695d8f82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/05bb2c54c9636556f2351df8c1d28c5b150036f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/05bb2c54c9636556f2351df8c1d28c5b150036f6","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDA1YmIyYzU0Yzk2MzY1NTZmMjM1MWRmOGMxZDI4YzViMTUwMDM2ZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/9f5021427bfdc571e5b15842eddc0d1f8a70cce6","sha":"9f5021427bfdc571e5b15842eddc0d1f8a70cce6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/9f5021427bfdc571e5b15842eddc0d1f8a70cce6"}],"sha":"05bb2c54c9636556f2351df8c1d28c5b150036f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/05bb2c54c9636556f2351df8c1d28c5b150036f6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/9f5021427bfdc571e5b15842eddc0d1f8a70cce6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T10:01:41Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T10:01:41Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"chore(release): 0.8.0 — worker-v2 live on platform-prod (V1 retired)\n\nReleased rev 27 to platform-prod. worker-v2 (the staged-bucket pipeline + the\napp↔worker HTTP ingress) replaces V1 as the ingest worker; the new queue-status\nIngérer UX ships with it. Verified live: worker_v2_up + 10 stages, fetch\nconcurrency 32 @ 300/min, app 307 / auth 200, broker OAuth 200.\n\n- package.json + Chart.yaml (version + appVersion) + values.yaml (app/worker/\n  broker image tags) → 0.8.0.\n- values.yaml worker.config.bnfFetchConcurrency 12 → 32 (the V1-era 12 throttled\n  fetch to ~178/min; 32 reaches the ~250/min broker/BnF ceiling — see the\n  concurrency-tuning commit). The other v2 lane concurrencies (describe 16,\n  ocr-submit 12, ocr-poll 16, embed 8) come from the image defaults — the\n  configmap doesn''t pin them.","tree":{"sha":"51d3d565a7063ca2a13f498caf009f47548c9bb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/51d3d565a7063ca2a13f498caf009f47548c9bb4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/9f5021427bfdc571e5b15842eddc0d1f8a70cce6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/9f5021427bfdc571e5b15842eddc0d1f8a70cce6","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDlmNTAyMTQyN2JmZGM1NzFlNWIxNTg0MmVkZGMwZDFmOGE3MGNjZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/3b878b23ae92932a92dea8a2b639e72651ff0014","sha":"3b878b23ae92932a92dea8a2b639e72651ff0014","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/3b878b23ae92932a92dea8a2b639e72651ff0014"}],"sha":"9f5021427bfdc571e5b15842eddc0d1f8a70cce6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/9f5021427bfdc571e5b15842eddc0d1f8a70cce6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/3b878b23ae92932a92dea8a2b639e72651ff0014/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T09:54:50Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T09:54:50Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(bnf): honest run-scoped queue-status + Decimal serialize fix + concurrency tuning\n\nFollow-ups from the first live Ingérer run on worker-v2:\n\n- Queue-status honesty: the stage rows showed pg-boss `done`/`failed`, which\n  ACCUMULATE across all runs (the buckets are shared, not run-scoped), so a fresh\n  run inherited stale failures that contradicted the run totals (\"1/2 en échec\"\n  vs \"0 échoués\"). Stage rows now show only current running/queued; failures live\n  solely in the run-scoped totals + the retry card.\n- BnF fetch box now shows run-scoped folios (récupérés X/Y + en file) from a new\n  DocState.folioCounts(runId) — honest, never the polluted pg-boss bucket. The\n  rate badges (≈300/min, ≈42/min) are removed from the UI per product (internal\n  detail, not for librarians); the worker read-model still carries the rates +\n  the new run-scoped folio tally.\n- Decimal serialize crash: serializeIngestJob converted `progress` but not\n  `paidOcrEstimatedUsd`/`paidOcrActualUsd`, so a paid-OCR job crashed the RSC\n  boundary (\"Decimal objects are not supported\"). Both are now flattened to\n  number|null, like progress. (Pre-existing latent bug, surfaced live.)\n- Concurrency: the fetch lane was 12 — measured ~178/min, well under the cap,\n  because it''s latency-bound (≈4–8s/fetch through the broker). Raised to 32\n  (clean measurement plateaus ~250/min at 32; 48 gives nothing more — the\n  broker/BnF is the ceiling, not the worker). Made the downstream lanes\n  env-tunable too with higher defaults: describe 4→16 (vision API, not BnF-\n  gated), ocr-submit 4→12, ocr-poll 8→16, embed 4→8 (DESCRIBE_CONCURRENCY,\n  OCR_SUBMIT_CONCURRENCY, OCR_POLL_CONCURRENCY, EMBED_CONCURRENCY,\n  BNF_FETCH_CONCURRENCY).\n\nworker-v2 158 tests + tsc green; app tsc + eslint + i18n green.","tree":{"sha":"09f79ca87a8a95227a3f532809754c3d0da4b1f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/09f79ca87a8a95227a3f532809754c3d0da4b1f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/3b878b23ae92932a92dea8a2b639e72651ff0014","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/3b878b23ae92932a92dea8a2b639e72651ff0014","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDNiODc4YjIzYWU5MjkzMmE5MmRlYThhMmI2MzllNzI2NTFmZjAwMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/2778fe229d5d0d5942f898faa7e35be4ff007aef","sha":"2778fe229d5d0d5942f898faa7e35be4ff007aef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/2778fe229d5d0d5942f898faa7e35be4ff007aef"}],"sha":"3b878b23ae92932a92dea8a2b639e72651ff0014","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/3b878b23ae92932a92dea8a2b639e72651ff0014"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/2778fe229d5d0d5942f898faa7e35be4ff007aef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T09:08:02Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T09:08:02Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"docs(alien-agents): check in create/review-agent skills; correct MCP transport docs\n\nThe agent-builder skill docs documented the MCP transport field as\n\"streamable_http\" | \"sse\" | \"stdio\" without noting that the platform''s\nMCP server node (workers DeepAgentCompiler) only accepts streamable_http\nand raises ValueError on sse/stdio. Annotated every API/SKILL shape so\nreaders know sse/stdio fail at runtime.\n\nThese skill trees were previously untracked; this is their first check-in.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce91fd8d2ea331896296360573e7a167d8c1a6b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/ce91fd8d2ea331896296360573e7a167d8c1a6b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/2778fe229d5d0d5942f898faa7e35be4ff007aef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/2778fe229d5d0d5942f898faa7e35be4ff007aef","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDI3NzhmZTIyOWQ1ZDBkNTk0MmY4OThmYWE3ZTM1YmU0ZmYwMDdhZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/66172f458c4f93cb421860bcb94b6eb2e68442a1","sha":"66172f458c4f93cb421860bcb94b6eb2e68442a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/66172f458c4f93cb421860bcb94b6eb2e68442a1"}],"sha":"2778fe229d5d0d5942f898faa7e35be4ff007aef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/2778fe229d5d0d5942f898faa7e35be4ff007aef"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/66172f458c4f93cb421860bcb94b6eb2e68442a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:56:10Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:56:10Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"refactor(worker): retire V1 — worker-v2 is the only ingest worker (clean break)\n\nworker-v2 becomes the worker the stack runs, and V1 (./worker) is deleted. No\ndual-worker, no flag — one push.\n\nSelf-containment (the real work): worker-v2''s live clients imported V1''s\nworker/src modules (vision, runpod, mistral-ocr, dataset + their transitive\nbroker-client/fetch-gate/gallica-relay/rate-limiter/env). That only resolved\non-host where ../worker existed; a standalone container failed with\nERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND. The nine modules are vendored verbatim into\nworker-v2/src/live/vendor/ (git tracks them as renames from V1, preserving\nprovenance) and the live clients now import from ./vendor/*. worker-v2 has zero\nreferences to worker/ — it builds and runs alone.\n\n- worker-v2/Dockerfile: node:24-alpine + tini, `npm start` (tsx main.ts). Builds\n  clean; the container now fails only on missing env (DATABASE_URL), proving the\n  module graph is self-contained.\n- docker-compose: the `ingest-worker` service builds ./worker-v2 (was ./worker),\n  same port 7777 / broker / postgres wiring; env_file ./worker-v2/.env (mirrors\n  V1''s var names).\n- deploy paths (deploy skill + helm/DEPLOY.md): build the worker image from\n  worker-v2/ under the SAME image repo name — no chart values change; the generic\n  worker Deployment already probes /health:7777 which worker-v2 serves.\n- ./worker deleted (59 tracked files). Untracked worker/.env + data remain on\n  disk locally; worker-v2/.env already holds the same creds for local runs.\n\n158 worker-v2 tests pass; app tsc + eslint clean (V1''s 3 lint warnings gone).","tree":{"sha":"6177b8603d9fbc61baf6c6b15e1ca3165c1c191d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/6177b8603d9fbc61baf6c6b15e1ca3165c1c191d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/66172f458c4f93cb421860bcb94b6eb2e68442a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/66172f458c4f93cb421860bcb94b6eb2e68442a1","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDY2MTcyZjQ1OGM0ZjkzY2I0MjE4NjBiY2I5NGI2ZWIyZTY4NDQyYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/2f01f0688d3f313fcaf663361d8a1ec2027e8428","sha":"2f01f0688d3f313fcaf663361d8a1ec2027e8428","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/2f01f0688d3f313fcaf663361d8a1ec2027e8428"}],"sha":"66172f458c4f93cb421860bcb94b6eb2e68442a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/66172f458c4f93cb421860bcb94b6eb2e68442a1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/2f01f0688d3f313fcaf663361d8a1ec2027e8428/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:43:17Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:43:17Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): Ingérer queue-status view fed by the worker read-model\n\nReplaces the four-stage pipeline card with V2''s live staged-bucket status — the\nhonest \"what''s actually happening\" view, with the 300/min BnF fetch as the\nheadline bottleneck. The old card was driven by per-stage callback stats that V2\nno longer emits mid-run (V2 sends only the terminal commit callback; the live UX\npolls instead).\n\n- GET /api/ingest/[job_id] now also returns `queue`: the worker''s\n  GET /progress/:runId read-model, proxied via IngestService.queueProgress →\n  ClusterRunner.progress → ClusterClient.progress (job→run by clusterJobId,\n  authorized by the existing IngestPolicy). Best-effort: null in fake mode, on a\n  terminal job, or when the worker is unreachable — the page degrades to the\n  reassurance banner. The version commit never depends on it.\n- components/cards/ingest/queue-status.tsx renders the named counters\n  (Documents finalisés headline, BnF fetch bucket + rate + ETA, the metadata /\n  image-description / AI-prep / Mistral-OCR / indexing groups) and the run totals\n  that ALWAYS reconcile — failed/skipped never hidden (the anti-V1 rule).\n- client.tsx wires it in place of CardIngestStagePipeline and now handles PARTIAL\n  (some docs indexed, some failed) explicitly: success CTA + retry-failed, not a\n  blanket \"Échec\". stage-pipeline.tsx deleted (dead).\n- ClusterQueueProgress contract + IngestJobStatusView type; useIngestStatus polls\n  the richer payload. fr/en i18n keys (ingest.queue.*) in the same commit.\n- worker-v2: buildProgress surfaces fetchRatePerMin for the rate headline; two\n  pre-existing lint nits fixed (rate.test let→const, doc-state-memory ternary).\n\nApp tsc + eslint clean; 158 worker-v2 tests pass. No frontend unit test added —\nthe app has no component-test framework (validated via the smoke script + the\nlive Phase 5 gate); the read-model/proxy contract is covered by server.test.ts.","tree":{"sha":"b188159b094fd8aa12ea9d2d686283ebbe019297","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/b188159b094fd8aa12ea9d2d686283ebbe019297"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/2f01f0688d3f313fcaf663361d8a1ec2027e8428","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/2f01f0688d3f313fcaf663361d8a1ec2027e8428","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDJmMDFmMDY4OGQzZjMxM2ZjYWY2NjMzNjFkOGExZWMyMDI3ZTg0Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/a882186a6c31b130f2b5e6008611d63b01dd8aa4","sha":"a882186a6c31b130f2b5e6008611d63b01dd8aa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/a882186a6c31b130f2b5e6008611d63b01dd8aa4"}],"sha":"2f01f0688d3f313fcaf663361d8a1ec2027e8428","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/2f01f0688d3f313fcaf663361d8a1ec2027e8428"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/a882186a6c31b130f2b5e6008611d63b01dd8aa4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:34:19Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:34:19Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(worker-v2): app↔worker HTTP ingress + terminal commit callback + run completion\n\nBrings worker-v2 (the staged-bucket ingest pipeline, proven standalone at 80/80\ndocs — broker 300/min is the ceiling, not the worker) into the tree AND wires it\nto the app''s two existing wire contracts so it can replace V1 as the ingestion\nworker. The pipeline, DocState fan-in, and the buildProgress read-model are\nunchanged; this adds the control plane around them.\n\nThe coupling to the app is exactly two contracts (confirmed by reading the app —\nit never touches V1''s internal tables; the Ingérer commit runs entirely off the\nprogress callback):\n\n- Inbound: POST /ingest (ClusterIngestRequest) → { clusterJobId }. A new tiny\n  Node http server (server.ts) validates the body (ingress.ts), opens an\n  ingest_run row (callback coords + target_version_id + app job id), seeds the\n  ARKs into the metadata bucket, and returns the run_id as the clusterJobId.\n- Outbound: ONE HMAC-signed terminal ClusterProgressEvent to the callback URL —\n  the app''s version-commit trigger. progress-callback.ts computes it from v2''s\n  OWN status counts (done/failed/skipped reconcile), signs sha256=<hex> over the\n  exact body bytes (the app verifier''s convention), and POSTs with retry. The\n  run-store latch makes it fire exactly once.\n\nRun scoping + completion:\n- ingest_run table + run_id on the doc rows (schema.sql); DocRef carries runId\n  through every payload. statusCounts gains a {projectId|runId} scope; new\n  listFailedDocs/donePageCount feed the terminal event''s errors[]/chunksWritten.\n- CompletionMonitor is wired to the pipeline''s existing onOutcome seam (no\n  stage monkey-patching): a doc reaching a terminal status triggers a per-run\n  completeness check → the single terminal emit. emit-kind outcomes (the folio\n  fan-out) are ignored; the run-wide query only runs once a doc is terminal.\n\nTerminal rule mirrors applyProgress: any success (or no hard failures) → \"done\"\n(pointer advances; partial failures reconciled per-ark from errors[]); a run\nwhere every doc failed → \"failed\" (pointer left behind). skipped/excluded go to\nstats.skipped, never errors[] — non-ingestable ARKs drop from the delta rather\nthan retry-loop. An empty (removal-only) run emits immediately so the app commits\nthe removal. GET /progress/:runId proxies buildProgress for the Ingérer poll.\n\nSelf-contained per the dual-undici lesson: HMAC is node:crypto, the POST is the\nglobal fetch — no app imports. 158 worker-v2 tests pass (ingress, callback,\ncompletion, full-pipeline-to-callback, server e2e), typecheck clean.","tree":{"sha":"dd1c3d627c04a0c9a0def07bd1773db8b27b8b23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/dd1c3d627c04a0c9a0def07bd1773db8b27b8b23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/a882186a6c31b130f2b5e6008611d63b01dd8aa4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/a882186a6c31b130f2b5e6008611d63b01dd8aa4","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGE4ODIxODZhNmMzMWIxMzBmMmI1ZTYwMDg2MTFkNjNiMDFkZDhhYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/3d3dc56e173ea5b3837b8957e76eae1df4974f70","sha":"3d3dc56e173ea5b3837b8957e76eae1df4974f70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/3d3dc56e173ea5b3837b8957e76eae1df4974f70"}],"sha":"a882186a6c31b130f2b5e6008611d63b01dd8aa4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/a882186a6c31b130f2b5e6008611d63b01dd8aa4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/3d3dc56e173ea5b3837b8957e76eae1df4974f70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T16:11:01Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T16:11:01Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"perf(worker): raise WORKER_CONCURRENCY 4→16 to keep the fetch gate fed\n\nThe fetch gate saturated the 300/min cap within each burst but throughput\naveraged only ~108/min (~36% of cap) in a sawtooth: at concurrency=4 the docs\nmoved as a synchronized cohort — fetch together to the cap, then all 4\nembed/index together (remote RunPod+cluster I/O, ~2-3 min) with fetch idle.\nRaising in-flight doc-jobs to 16 desynchronizes the convoy so some docs fetch\nwhile others embed/index, keeping the gate continuously fed toward sustained\n~300/min. Cannot over-fetch BnF — bnfFetchConcurrency still caps fetches at 12.\nConfig-only (worker configmap); bound is worker RAM, watch RSS.","tree":{"sha":"35e0ef553e78b612739e62dbdcdd4cbe83febd61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/35e0ef553e78b612739e62dbdcdd4cbe83febd61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/3d3dc56e173ea5b3837b8957e76eae1df4974f70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/3d3dc56e173ea5b3837b8957e76eae1df4974f70","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDNkM2RjNTZlMTczZWE1YjM4MzdiODk1N2U3NmVhZTFkZjQ5NzRmNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/44fec7af4eb4c671dceadfcb74ead3702567fbe8","sha":"44fec7af4eb4c671dceadfcb74ead3702567fbe8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/44fec7af4eb4c671dceadfcb74ead3702567fbe8"}],"sha":"3d3dc56e173ea5b3837b8957e76eae1df4974f70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/3d3dc56e173ea5b3837b8957e76eae1df4974f70"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/44fec7af4eb4c671dceadfcb74ead3702567fbe8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T15:45:05Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T15:45:05Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"chore(release): 0.7.1 — Mistral OCR IIIF `max` fix to platform-prod\n\nBumped app/worker/broker image tags, chart version and appVersion to 0.7.1 and\nreleased to platform-prod (rev 24). Stops the Mistral OCR image-fetch 400 storm.","tree":{"sha":"f263fd16122238183af4614128d9765857baa08a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/f263fd16122238183af4614128d9765857baa08a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/44fec7af4eb4c671dceadfcb74ead3702567fbe8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/44fec7af4eb4c671dceadfcb74ead3702567fbe8","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDQ0ZmVjN2FmNGViNGM2NzFkY2VhZGZjYjc0ZWFkMzcwMjU2N2ZiZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/0fe8900a3fbc7f2aa23fec3ecdc8322bb807e2ad","sha":"0fe8900a3fbc7f2aa23fec3ecdc8322bb807e2ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/0fe8900a3fbc7f2aa23fec3ecdc8322bb807e2ad"}],"sha":"44fec7af4eb4c671dceadfcb74ead3702567fbe8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/44fec7af4eb4c671dceadfcb74ead3702567fbe8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/0fe8900a3fbc7f2aa23fec3ecdc8322bb807e2ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T15:45:05Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T15:45:05Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(worker): use IIIF `max` for Mistral OCR images + fast-fail on doc-wide 4xx\n\nThe Mistral OCR fallback requested a fixed `!2000,2000`, but BnF''s IIIF v3 image\nserver REJECTS (HTTP 400, no clamp) any explicit w/h above the image''s\nmaxWidth/maxHeight. Low-res docs (e.g. bpt6k91000284, native 1524×2048) failed\nevery folio — 300 guaranteed-400 fetches, 300 wasted quota tokens, doc skipped.\n\n- MISTRAL_OCR_IIIF_SIZE → \"max\" (IIIF v3 native keyword): clamped per-image, so\n  it never 400s and still hands Mistral the full native resolution the doc has\n  (better for dense type than the vision path''s 1280; Mistral has no documented\n  resolution it would waste). getImageUrl maps \"max\"→\"full\" on the legacy v2 path.\n- New typed ImageFetchError(status); extractMistralOcr probes the first canvas and\n  fails fast on a 4xx (a doc-wide condition) — one token instead of N.","tree":{"sha":"ba653ec8fba1b85959cef52ae69dfc1d4da9a47b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/ba653ec8fba1b85959cef52ae69dfc1d4da9a47b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/0fe8900a3fbc7f2aa23fec3ecdc8322bb807e2ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/0fe8900a3fbc7f2aa23fec3ecdc8322bb807e2ad","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDBmZTg5MDBhM2ZiYzdmMmFhMjNmZWMzZWNkYzgzMjJiYjgwN2UyYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/7956bce0b6af1def69fde82009934adc198483e6","sha":"7956bce0b6af1def69fde82009934adc198483e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/7956bce0b6af1def69fde82009934adc198483e6"}],"sha":"0fe8900a3fbc7f2aa23fec3ecdc8322bb807e2ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/0fe8900a3fbc7f2aa23fec3ecdc8322bb807e2ad"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/7956bce0b6af1def69fde82009934adc198483e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T13:53:25Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T13:53:25Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"chore(bnf): wire + enable Mistral fallback OCR on the prod worker (chart 0.7.1)\n\nThe 0.7.0 images already contain the Mistral OCR code, but the chart never wired\nit — so prod offered paid OCR (paidOcrEnabled migration ran) while the worker had\nno key and MISTRAL_OCR_ENABLED unset, i.e. it would skip confirmed sans_texte\ndocs after charging the budget. Config-only fix (images stay :0.7.0):\n\n- values: secrets.mistralApiKeyProperty + worker.config.mistralOcr* (enabled,\n  model, maxPages, poll, batch timeout).\n- worker ExternalSecret: project MISTRAL_API_KEY into worker-creds (gated on\n  mistralOcrEnabled).\n- worker configmap: MISTRAL_OCR_* env.\n- Chart 0.7.1 (appVersion stays 0.7.0 — no app/worker code change).\n\nDeployed: rev 23 on platform-prod. Scaleway secret bnf-demo-prod gained\nMISTRAL_API_KEY (rev 5). Verified: worker env set + key present, worker reaches\napi.mistral.ai (200, ocr model present), site 307/200, all pods 1/1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c85284bae47354e01c3294629bbe41b5c646cb54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/c85284bae47354e01c3294629bbe41b5c646cb54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/7956bce0b6af1def69fde82009934adc198483e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/7956bce0b6af1def69fde82009934adc198483e6","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDc5NTZiY2UwYjZhZjFkZWY2OWZkZTgyMDA5OTM0YWRjMTk4NDgzZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/01d5a2c84dc935813cf2ec7ebbbd3d158fc2ee41","sha":"01d5a2c84dc935813cf2ec7ebbbd3d158fc2ee41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/01d5a2c84dc935813cf2ec7ebbbd3d158fc2ee41"}],"sha":"7956bce0b6af1def69fde82009934adc198483e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/7956bce0b6af1def69fde82009934adc198483e6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/01d5a2c84dc935813cf2ec7ebbbd3d158fc2ee41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T13:21:19Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T13:21:19Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"docs(broker): add the 3000/min quota runbook and saturation evidence\n\nExpanded the \"caps will rise\" stub into a turnkey runbook: raising the global\nquota is two values (broker globalRpm + worker bnfFetchConcurrency≈48), a helm\nupgrade, and a /calls.csv verify — no code change. Documented how the worker''s\nfetch semaphore saturates the cap and recorded the measured 300/min evidence\n(12 permits → sustained 300/min, freeze=0/shed=0, wait p50 2.3s). Also corrected\nthe stale 12/min manifest cap to the current 40/min.","tree":{"sha":"12b912f059150d953b4b9d67dd9fef9bc76a4c2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/12b912f059150d953b4b9d67dd9fef9bc76a4c2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/01d5a2c84dc935813cf2ec7ebbbd3d158fc2ee41","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/01d5a2c84dc935813cf2ec7ebbbd3d158fc2ee41","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDAxZDVhMmM4NGRjOTM1ODEzY2YyZWM3ZWJiYmQzZDE1OGZjMmVlNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/f0d898e1539ebf6fb46ec5322da33d748c6eddf7","sha":"f0d898e1539ebf6fb46ec5322da33d748c6eddf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/f0d898e1539ebf6fb46ec5322da33d748c6eddf7"}],"sha":"01d5a2c84dc935813cf2ec7ebbbd3d158fc2ee41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/01d5a2c84dc935813cf2ec7ebbbd3d158fc2ee41"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/f0d898e1539ebf6fb46ec5322da33d748c6eddf7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T13:16:08Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T13:16:08Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"chore(release): 0.7.0 — fetch semaphore + 403-permanent to platform-prod\n\nBumped app/worker/broker image tags, chart version and appVersion to 0.7.0 and\nreleased to platform-prod. Ships the global fetch semaphore (BNF_FETCH_CONCURRENCY)\nand the 403-Forbidden permanent classification. Broker now runs global=300/min.","tree":{"sha":"4e438bdaef448f89c62baf9bdb6a9bd18503ce33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/4e438bdaef448f89c62baf9bdb6a9bd18503ce33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/f0d898e1539ebf6fb46ec5322da33d748c6eddf7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/f0d898e1539ebf6fb46ec5322da33d748c6eddf7","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGYwZDg5OGUxNTM5ZWJmNmZiNDZlYzUzMjJkYTMzZDc0OGM2ZWRkZjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/53872c69668fc6e2a5b71905e7fed5363fa747f8","sha":"53872c69668fc6e2a5b71905e7fed5363fa747f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/53872c69668fc6e2a5b71905e7fed5363fa747f8"}],"sha":"f0d898e1539ebf6fb46ec5322da33d748c6eddf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/f0d898e1539ebf6fb46ec5322da33d748c6eddf7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/53872c69668fc6e2a5b71905e7fed5363fa747f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T13:06:32Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T13:06:32Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(worker): treat BnF 403 Forbidden as permanent, not transient\n\nAccess-restricted documents (rights-restricted, on-site-only, embargoed) return\n403 {\"reason\":\"Forbidden\"} from the partner API. classifyStatus lumped 403 into\nthe catch-all transient bucket, so those docs retried 6 times — looping for ~30\nminutes and burning the shared BnF quota — before finally failing.\n\nClassified 403 as PermanentBnfError(\"forbidden\") so the doc-job is skipped\nimmediately. 403 is distinct from rate limiting (429) and from an expired token\n(the broker owns and re-mints OAuth before the worker sees the response), so a\n403 reaching the worker is always a terminal per-document access decision.","tree":{"sha":"7b6d3b79997e6fe17193f73aabc8ecd1e11d3b66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/7b6d3b79997e6fe17193f73aabc8ecd1e11d3b66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/53872c69668fc6e2a5b71905e7fed5363fa747f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/53872c69668fc6e2a5b71905e7fed5363fa747f8","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDUzODcyYzY5NjY4ZmM2ZTJhNWI3MTkwNWU3ZmVkNTM2M2ZhNzQ3Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/9ae9d078cee65e339a257775274dc430584f878a","sha":"9ae9d078cee65e339a257775274dc430584f878a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/9ae9d078cee65e339a257775274dc430584f878a"}],"sha":"53872c69668fc6e2a5b71905e7fed5363fa747f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/53872c69668fc6e2a5b71905e7fed5363fa747f8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/9ae9d078cee65e339a257775274dc430584f878a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T12:52:49Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T12:52:49Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(worker): saturate the broker rate cap with a global fetch semaphore\n\nDecoupled BnF fetch concurrency from the per-document lifecycle so the worker\nkeeps the broker''s rate bucket continuously fed. Fetch throughput no longer\ncollapses while a document sits in chunk/embed/index, and raising the BnF quota\nbecomes a config flip that actually yields the extra throughput.\n\n- Added a process-global FIFO counting semaphore (fetch-gate.ts) sized by\n  BNF_FETCH_CONCURRENCY (default 12). It bounds in-flight requests only; the\n  broker stays the sole rate authority, so there is no double-throttle.\n- Routed every worker->broker call through the gate at the single chokepoint\n  (brokerGet), covering ALTO, OAI, manifest, SRU and image fetches uniformly.\n- Widened the per-doc ALTO page fan-out to the gate size and removed the now-dead\n  altoConcurrency()/BNF_ALTO_CONCURRENCY per-doc limiter (no-op on the gated path).\n- Surfaced BNF_FETCH_CONCURRENCY through worker env and the helm chart, and set\n  the broker global quota to the corrected 300/min. Scaling to 3000/min is now\n  two env values (broker BNF_GLOBAL_RPM + worker BNF_FETCH_CONCURRENCY), no code.\n- Added tsx-runnable fetch-gate assertions (never-exceeds-N, release-on-throw, FIFO).","tree":{"sha":"3418689e8edde6d2bfc21efe3dc5bb89b0547d30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/3418689e8edde6d2bfc21efe3dc5bb89b0547d30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/9ae9d078cee65e339a257775274dc430584f878a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/9ae9d078cee65e339a257775274dc430584f878a","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDlhZTlkMDc4Y2VlNjVlMzM5YTI1Nzc3NTI3NGRjNDMwNTg0Zjg3OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/75032b7762e5d6928cbd53440c0b48dc8d6eabe6","sha":"75032b7762e5d6928cbd53440c0b48dc8d6eabe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/75032b7762e5d6928cbd53440c0b48dc8d6eabe6"}],"sha":"9ae9d078cee65e339a257775274dc430584f878a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/9ae9d078cee65e339a257775274dc430584f878a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/75032b7762e5d6928cbd53440c0b48dc8d6eabe6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T12:28:25Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T12:28:25Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(bnf): stop Ingérer cards from clipping their footer (submit button)\n\nThe cards live in a flex-col scroll container; flex items default to shrink:1,\nso when the column overflows the viewport the cards get squeezed below their\ncontent height, and the Card primitive''s overflow-hidden (needed for rounded\ncorners) clips the footer — the \"Lancer une ingestion\" button was half-hidden.\nThe taller paid-OCR opt-in panel made it reproducible. Add *:shrink-0 so cards\nkeep their natural height and the container scrolls instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"41defee6b0fc0f6788b3d5427c1466291322a2f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/41defee6b0fc0f6788b3d5427c1466291322a2f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/75032b7762e5d6928cbd53440c0b48dc8d6eabe6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/75032b7762e5d6928cbd53440c0b48dc8d6eabe6","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDc1MDMyYjc3NjJlNWQ2OTI4Y2JkNTM0NDBjMGI0OGRjOGQ2ZWFiZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/038f1f577efe6b3d880504a045504b0c3d42061d","sha":"038f1f577efe6b3d880504a045504b0c3d42061d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/038f1f577efe6b3d880504a045504b0c3d42061d"}],"sha":"75032b7762e5d6928cbd53440c0b48dc8d6eabe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/75032b7762e5d6928cbd53440c0b48dc8d6eabe6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/038f1f577efe6b3d880504a045504b0c3d42061d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T12:24:41Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T12:24:41Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(bnf): make paid OCR an explicit, budget-gated opt-in (never silent)\n\nThe sans_texte docs were entangled with the regular ingest: a delta containing\nthem blocked the WHOLE submit behind a confirmation, and over budget nothing ran\nat all — even the normally-ingestable docs. And the UI showed the (e.g.) $446\nline as if you could just proceed.\n\nNow:\n- submit() runs the REGULAR delta always; sans_texte docs are folded in ONLY\n  when confirmPaidOcr is set AND within budget. Not opted-in → they are left\n  untouched, never sent silently. Over budget → budget_exceeded, nothing\n  dispatched (server backstop). Removed the confirmation_required outcome\n  (confirmation is now client-driven).\n- previewDelta returns paidOcrBudget { spentUsd, ceilingUsd, withinBudget } so\n  the UI gates the opt-in on real budget headroom (server re-checks on submit).\n- Ingérer summary: sans_texte is a separate amber opt-in panel showing cost vs\n  the platform budget. In budget → an explicit \"Inclure l''océrisation\" toggle;\n  over budget → \"océrisation indisponible, les autres documents seront ingérés\n  normalement\" (no toggle). Main CTA ingests the regular delta; \"+ océrisation\"\n  only when opted in. Confirm dialog before any spend; budget backstop dialog.\n- agent ingest tool: ingests the regular delta only, never opts into spend.\n- fr/en copy for the panel + states (keys at parity).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6fbac6fa79dc05abe2ecea8751805044e625e4c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/6fbac6fa79dc05abe2ecea8751805044e625e4c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/038f1f577efe6b3d880504a045504b0c3d42061d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/038f1f577efe6b3d880504a045504b0c3d42061d","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDAzOGYxZjU3N2VmZTZiM2Q4ODA1MDRhMDQ1NTA0YjBjM2Q0MjA2MWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/86f6790151c813edd84a5087baca66790ca3cf11","sha":"86f6790151c813edd84a5087baca66790ca3cf11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/86f6790151c813edd84a5087baca66790ca3cf11"}],"sha":"038f1f577efe6b3d880504a045504b0c3d42061d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/038f1f577efe6b3d880504a045504b0c3d42061d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/86f6790151c813edd84a5087baca66790ca3cf11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T12:15:15Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T12:15:15Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(bnf): reword paid-OCR copy — platform cost, not user payment\n\n\"Océrisation payante\" / \"Paid OCR\" read as if the librarian pays out of pocket.\nReframe as on-demand OCR that has a cost for the platform, to be used mindfully:\n- summary line: \"océrisation à la demande (≈ {cost} $ pour la plateforme)\"\n- dialog: \"Océrisation à la demande\" + \"Ce traitement a un coût pour la\n  plateforme (≈ {cost} $ US) — à utiliser à bon escient.\"\nfr + en, keys at parity.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0caf9eda782d86bb371c0f30ff97b09430b8712e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/0caf9eda782d86bb371c0f30ff97b09430b8712e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/86f6790151c813edd84a5087baca66790ca3cf11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/86f6790151c813edd84a5087baca66790ca3cf11","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDg2ZjY3OTAxNTFjODEzZWRkODRhNTA4N2JhY2E2Njc5MGNhM2NmMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/622083dfbc8d3e97be50608a20b55007fdca1e7f","sha":"622083dfbc8d3e97be50608a20b55007fdca1e7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/622083dfbc8d3e97be50608a20b55007fdca1e7f"}],"sha":"86f6790151c813edd84a5087baca66790ca3cf11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/86f6790151c813edd84a5087baca66790ca3cf11"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/622083dfbc8d3e97be50608a20b55007fdca1e7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T12:11:06Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T12:11:06Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): restrict paid OCR to Latin-script documents\n\nTesting showed Mistral OCR mangles non-Latin scripts (16th-c. Greek came back\nas garbled Greek letters — wrong words, broken accents). We won''t offer or\ncharge for OCR we can''t faithfully produce.\n\n- isLatinScriptLang(lang) in models/documents/schema.ts: non-Latin ISO codes\n  (grc/ar/he + the broader Greek/Hebrew/Arabic/CJK/Cyrillic/Indic set) → false;\n  Latin and null/unknown → true (the BnF print corpus is French/Latin-dominant,\n  and null means \"unresolved\", not \"non-Latin\" — genuinely non-Latin docs carry\n  an explicit code).\n- _partitionByIngestability gates the paidOcr bucket on it: a non-Latin\n  sans_texte doc falls through to `excluded` (honestly non-ingestable), so it is\n  never offered in the confirmation dialog, never charged, never sent to the\n  worker. previewDelta inherits this (same partition).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"95fec0180fc5d95823cec2dc8e39745f1bf9bc2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/95fec0180fc5d95823cec2dc8e39745f1bf9bc2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/622083dfbc8d3e97be50608a20b55007fdca1e7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/622083dfbc8d3e97be50608a20b55007fdca1e7f","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDYyMjA4M2RmYmM4ZDNlOTdiZTUwNjA4YTIwYjU1MDA3ZmRjYTFlN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/b421f0277da4b251b2914f4d9b91063341e43332","sha":"b421f0277da4b251b2914f4d9b91063341e43332","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/b421f0277da4b251b2914f4d9b91063341e43332"}],"sha":"622083dfbc8d3e97be50608a20b55007fdca1e7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/622083dfbc8d3e97be50608a20b55007fdca1e7f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/b421f0277da4b251b2914f4d9b91063341e43332/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T11:46:14Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T11:46:14Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): authorize paid OCR by default\n\nFlip Project.paidOcrEnabled to default-true and backfill existing projects, so\npaid fallback OCR is offered everywhere without DB surgery. The actual spend is\nstill gated per-ingestion by the explicit « Océrisation payante » confirmation\ndialog; this flag remains a per-project kill-switch. (Backfill flips only rows\nstill at the old default, so an intentional opt-out is never overwritten.)\n\nWorker still requires MISTRAL_OCR_ENABLED=true + MISTRAL_API_KEY to run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"662a1682e6d58c8a4182000e4df22a8430c968e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/662a1682e6d58c8a4182000e4df22a8430c968e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/b421f0277da4b251b2914f4d9b91063341e43332","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/b421f0277da4b251b2914f4d9b91063341e43332","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGI0MjFmMDI3N2RhNGIyNTFiMjkxNGY0ZDliOTEwNjMzNDFlNDMzMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/c6bad8b3b2897fddf33e21714d8e2cba5170f87e","sha":"c6bad8b3b2897fddf33e21714d8e2cba5170f87e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/c6bad8b3b2897fddf33e21714d8e2cba5170f87e"}],"sha":"b421f0277da4b251b2914f4d9b91063341e43332","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/b421f0277da4b251b2914f4d9b91063341e43332"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/c6bad8b3b2897fddf33e21714d8e2cba5170f87e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T11:10:47Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T11:10:47Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): drop hallucinated Mistral OCR pages (blank-page guard)\n\nLive testing revealed Mistral OCR fabricates content on blank/near-blank\nfolios instead of returning empty — repeating one filler line dozens of\ntimes (\"…simple diagram and cannot be extracted.\") and injecting unrelated\ntext (CJK boilerplate, leaked instructions). Indexing that would let the\nresearch agent cite fabricated text against a real folio.\n\nPer-page confidence does NOT catch it (a garbage page scored avg 0.968 vs\n0.936 for a clean one — the model is confidently wrong), so the guard keys on\nthe structural tells: the same ≥12-char line repeated ≥4×, or ≥2 blank-region\nfiller/instruction-leak markers. Counting absolute repeats (not a ratio)\navoids false-positiving a real page that is one long unbroken paragraph\n(verified: 0 false positives across 8 folios of a 1551 Timaeus; the one true\nblank verso was dropped).\n\n- looksLikeHallucinatedOcr() in mistral-ocr.ts; gated raw-output debug dump.\n- extract.ts drops flagged folios (→ blank page, no citation) and logs the\n  count — never silent. Cost is logged on fetched folios (we pay per folio\n  regardless of the guard).\n- scripts/dbg-mistral-ocr.ts: diagnostic that tabulates confidence vs the\n  repetition guard over a folio range (how the above was established).\n\nValidated end-to-end: prepare:one on ark:/12148/bpt6k325159w dropped the blank\nverso (f2), kept f1+f3, stamped ocr_provider=mistral, persisted to S3, and a\nre-run was a cache hit (zero re-spend).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"54f482b6027081620c6bd711070016f83c73be27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/54f482b6027081620c6bd711070016f83c73be27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/c6bad8b3b2897fddf33e21714d8e2cba5170f87e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/c6bad8b3b2897fddf33e21714d8e2cba5170f87e","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGM2YmFkOGIzYjI4OTdmZGRmMzNlMjE3MTRkOGUyY2JhNTE3MGY4N2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/b92215514765611c2a4b7bdf62c464fb27d73661","sha":"b92215514765611c2a4b7bdf62c464fb27d73661","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/b92215514765611c2a4b7bdf62c464fb27d73661"}],"sha":"c6bad8b3b2897fddf33e21714d8e2cba5170f87e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/c6bad8b3b2897fddf33e21714d8e2cba5170f87e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/b92215514765611c2a4b7bdf62c464fb27d73661/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:47:21Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:47:21Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): account paid-OCR spend against the project budget on commit\n\nCloses the budget loop. When a job that used paid OCR reaches a terminal\ncommit (done or partial), charge the confirmed estimate to\nProject.paidOcrSpentUsd and stamp IngestJob.paidOcrActualUsd.\n\n- _paidOcrChargeFor(job): set-once guard (null once paidOcrActualUsd is\n  recorded, so a re-delivered commit can''t double-charge) returning the\n  confirmed estimate. Conservative: capped page counts never under-count, the\n  safe direction for the ceiling enforced at submit time.\n- commit() and commitPartialFailure() fold the charge into their existing\n  atomic transaction (job stamp + project increment together).\n\nThe plan''s per-doc cluster \"paidOcr\" marker is intentionally dropped: the app\nalready filters which sans_texte docs are sent and the worker env-gates Mistral,\nso a per-doc marker would be redundant. A whole-job FAILED (which never commits)\nis the one path that escapes accounting — acceptably rare for a guardrail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b7f352b7845bd2e38d31d4f1d642f6966b47d4e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/b7f352b7845bd2e38d31d4f1d642f6966b47d4e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/b92215514765611c2a4b7bdf62c464fb27d73661","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/b92215514765611c2a4b7bdf62c464fb27d73661","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGI5MjIxNTUxNDc2NTYxMWMyYTRiN2JkZjYyYzQ2NGZiMjdkNzM2NjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/ca172c5f073ead87075570849929a9c11e39bfe6","sha":"ca172c5f073ead87075570849929a9c11e39bfe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/ca172c5f073ead87075570849929a9c11e39bfe6"}],"sha":"b92215514765611c2a4b7bdf62c464fb27d73661","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/b92215514765611c2a4b7bdf62c464fb27d73661"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/ca172c5f073ead87075570849929a9c11e39bfe6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:45:32Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:45:32Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): paid-OCR confirmation UI on the Ingérer step\n\nSurfaces the paid fallback OCR handshake to the librarian.\n\n- useSubmitIngest returns the job | paid-OCR outcome union; isPaidOcrOutcome\n  guard; submit accepts confirmPaidOcr.\n- New DialogIngestPaidOcrConfirm: confirmation state (N docs · ~$X, confirm the\n  spend) and budget-exceeded state (spent / cap). Re-submits with the spend\n  authorized on confirm.\n- Ingérer client routes the outcome: a job polls, a paid-OCR outcome opens the\n  dialog. Summary card shows the \"N sans OCR · ~$X (paid OCR)\" line and stays\n  actionable when the delta is paid-OCR-only.\n- previewDelta.paidOcr threaded page → client → summary.\n- fr/en i18n for the line + dialog (keys at parity).\n\nNote: the corpus-view numérisation relabel is intentionally deferred — gating\nis per-ingestion, so the spend prompt lives on the Ingérer step, not the corpus\nstats. Tracked for Phase 5/polish.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cacc3f3bb36f4ebea7ea3793975a00d1f78279ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/cacc3f3bb36f4ebea7ea3793975a00d1f78279ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/ca172c5f073ead87075570849929a9c11e39bfe6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/ca172c5f073ead87075570849929a9c11e39bfe6","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGNhMTcyYzVmMDczZWFkODcwNzU1NzA4NDk5MjlhOWMxMWUzOWJmZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/860eaafd55ce9608be6d2348838f381281625a87","sha":"860eaafd55ce9608be6d2348838f381281625a87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/860eaafd55ce9608be6d2348838f381281625a87"}],"sha":"ca172c5f073ead87075570849929a9c11e39bfe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/ca172c5f073ead87075570849929a9c11e39bfe6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/860eaafd55ce9608be6d2348838f381281625a87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:34:38Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:34:38Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): Mistral fallback OCR for sans_texte documents (worker)\n\nTranscribe digitized text with no BnF OCR layer via the Mistral OCR Batch\nAPI ($2/1000 pages), env-gated (MISTRAL_OCR_ENABLED, default off).\n\n- mistral-ocr.ts: isolated Batch API mechanics — one job per doc, one JSONL\n  entry per folio image, custom_id = f<ordre> so folio alignment is by\n  construction (not positional). Poll bounded by MISTRAL_OCR_BATCH_TIMEOUT_MS\n  (under the doc-job ceiling), download + map results back to folios.\n- extract.ts: new `sans_texte` branch — fetch the IIIF manifest, pull each\n  folio image through vision.fetchImage (same broker/relay/rate-limit path, so\n  we never hand Gallica URLs to Mistral), base64 them, run one batch. Returns\n  text_with_ocr-shaped pages so render/chunk/index are unchanged. Per-doc folio\n  cap + skip-on-empty.\n- vision.ts: export fetchImage for reuse.\n- Provenance: DocMetadata.ocrProvider + per-chunk ocr_provider=\"mistral\",\n  added to the cluster dataset schema for audit/filtering.\n- No-double-pay is the existing processed-doc cache (doc.md/json/chunks): a\n  re-ingest of a transcribed doc is a cache hit and never re-calls Mistral.\n- env.ts + .env.example: MISTRAL_* config. Adds @mistralai/mistralai.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"975cb0c403153e24242095e2fa099804f094d3de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/975cb0c403153e24242095e2fa099804f094d3de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/860eaafd55ce9608be6d2348838f381281625a87","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/860eaafd55ce9608be6d2348838f381281625a87","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDg2MGVhYWZkNTVjZTk2MDhiZTZkMjM0ODgzOGYzODEyODE2MjVhODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/eb42ee0ff06380419e96c74f9e79a7da0af5b843","sha":"eb42ee0ff06380419e96c74f9e79a7da0af5b843","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/eb42ee0ff06380419e96c74f9e79a7da0af5b843"}],"sha":"860eaafd55ce9608be6d2348838f381281625a87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/860eaafd55ce9608be6d2348838f381281625a87"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/eb42ee0ff06380419e96c74f9e79a7da0af5b843/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:31:39Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:31:39Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"chore(bnf): release 0.6.2","tree":{"sha":"a8565178deb92e43afe5878dc92d78bfc6a4adbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/a8565178deb92e43afe5878dc92d78bfc6a4adbc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/eb42ee0ff06380419e96c74f9e79a7da0af5b843","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/eb42ee0ff06380419e96c74f9e79a7da0af5b843","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGViNDJlZTBmZjA2MzgwNDE5ZTk2Yzc0ZjllNzlhN2RhMGFmNWI4NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/e7a201401e475912a5b093c9c0135078575929c7","sha":"e7a201401e475912a5b093c9c0135078575929c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/e7a201401e475912a5b093c9c0135078575929c7"}],"sha":"eb42ee0ff06380419e96c74f9e79a7da0af5b843","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/eb42ee0ff06380419e96c74f9e79a7da0af5b843"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/e7a201401e475912a5b093c9c0135078575929c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:30:53Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:30:53Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"chore(worker): add @mistralai/mistralai dependency","tree":{"sha":"0a4a3c16d69c8ac24cb765110260d9166ea71d62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/0a4a3c16d69c8ac24cb765110260d9166ea71d62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/e7a201401e475912a5b093c9c0135078575929c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/e7a201401e475912a5b093c9c0135078575929c7","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGU3YTIwMTQwMWU0NzU5MTJhNWIwOTNjOWMwMTM1MDc4NTc1OTI5Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/f2c52f473c00cf80586d8f82b397ead471638280","sha":"f2c52f473c00cf80586d8f82b397ead471638280","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/f2c52f473c00cf80586d8f82b397ead471638280"}],"sha":"e7a201401e475912a5b093c9c0135078575929c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/e7a201401e475912a5b093c9c0135078575929c7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/f2c52f473c00cf80586d8f82b397ead471638280/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:30:53Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:30:53Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"chore(bnf): pace and make doc-type backfill resumable\n\nRe-fetch the OAI in small paced batches (--batch/--delay) to stay under the shared broker rate cap, and rewrite each fetched ARK so a later run reclassifies locally. Adds --limit for chunked backfills across runs.","tree":{"sha":"c3684127afe0f5708b30cddd5c514dcb8802dad1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/c3684127afe0f5708b30cddd5c514dcb8802dad1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/f2c52f473c00cf80586d8f82b397ead471638280","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/f2c52f473c00cf80586d8f82b397ead471638280","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGYyYzUyZjQ3M2MwMGNmODA1ODZkOGY4MmIzOTdlYWQ0NzE2MzgyODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/bf8e8979ca52d74d36150233e96bf27b80d30db5","sha":"bf8e8979ca52d74d36150233e96bf27b80d30db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/bf8e8979ca52d74d36150233e96bf27b80d30db5"}],"sha":"f2c52f473c00cf80586d8f82b397ead471638280","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/f2c52f473c00cf80586d8f82b397ead471638280"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/bf8e8979ca52d74d36150233e96bf27b80d30db5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:30:53Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:30:53Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): persist tool contentOffset for interleaved replay\n\nAdd ToolCall.content_offset (nullable) so a reopened session rebuilds the true text/tool chronology instead of grouping all tools ahead of the text. Bumps chat-sdk to 0.8.3 (carries contentOffset on the tool events). Legacy rows stay null (grouped order).","tree":{"sha":"fdf5d5ff37e768b85155f0fe2500580771e473b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/fdf5d5ff37e768b85155f0fe2500580771e473b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/bf8e8979ca52d74d36150233e96bf27b80d30db5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/bf8e8979ca52d74d36150233e96bf27b80d30db5","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGJmOGU4OTc5Y2E1MmQ3NGQzNjE1MDIzM2U5NmJmMjdiODBkMzBkYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/8796ab1a29717646c9e96d124e9fdd06969c8e53","sha":"8796ab1a29717646c9e96d124e9fdd06969c8e53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/8796ab1a29717646c9e96d124e9fdd06969c8e53"}],"sha":"bf8e8979ca52d74d36150233e96bf27b80d30db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/bf8e8979ca52d74d36150233e96bf27b80d30db5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/8796ab1a29717646c9e96d124e9fdd06969c8e53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:30:53Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:30:53Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): ask_user takes over the composer like Claude Code\n\nRender the agent''s ask_user question in the composer slot (tabs per question, radio/checkbox options with label+description, auto-advance, per-question free-text \"Autre\" escape, Esc/Enter shortcuts) instead of an inline card buried in the message stream. The answer comes back as a normal user bubble. Removes the old CardToolAskUser inline card.","tree":{"sha":"109a778f9d00d6e18ad501fb29bd6ea3ebd7c1dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/109a778f9d00d6e18ad501fb29bd6ea3ebd7c1dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/8796ab1a29717646c9e96d124e9fdd06969c8e53","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/8796ab1a29717646c9e96d124e9fdd06969c8e53","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDg3OTZhYjFhMjk3MTc2NDZjOWU5NmQxMjRlOWZkZDA2OTY5YzhlNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/55fd6f4577bbac3c76a80c1df08d17b07c38c24e","sha":"55fd6f4577bbac3c76a80c1df08d17b07c38c24e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/55fd6f4577bbac3c76a80c1df08d17b07c38c24e"}],"sha":"8796ab1a29717646c9e96d124e9fdd06969c8e53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/8796ab1a29717646c9e96d124e9fdd06969c8e53"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/55fd6f4577bbac3c76a80c1df08d17b07c38c24e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:19:07Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:19:07Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): paid-OCR confirmation handshake in ingest submit\n\nServer-side gating for paid fallback OCR. Gated behind project.paidOcrEnabled\n(default false), so every existing project is byte-for-byte unchanged.\n\n- ingestSubmitSchema += confirmPaidOcr; submit() now returns an\n  IngestSubmitOutcome union: job | confirmation_required | budget_exceeded.\n- submit() folds confirmed `sans_texte` docs into the delta, enforces the\n  per-project budget ceiling (paidOcrBudgetUsd ?? default), and records\n  paidOcrArks + paidOcrEstimatedUsd on the job. Dedup runs before the gate so\n  an in-flight job is reused without re-prompting.\n- previewDelta surfaces the paid-OCR doc count + USD estimate (same partition,\n  so the preview can''t drift from a real submit).\n- Ingest route returns the bare IngestJobView on the happy path (unchanged) and\n  a typed { kind, … } body for the paid-OCR outcomes.\n- Agent ingest tool never auto-confirms spend: it relays\n  confirmation_required / budget_exceeded back to the librarian.\n- smoke-test unwraps the new outcome union.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"16a1fafe1b812dfedff3580469b4c77095fc771a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/16a1fafe1b812dfedff3580469b4c77095fc771a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/55fd6f4577bbac3c76a80c1df08d17b07c38c24e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/55fd6f4577bbac3c76a80c1df08d17b07c38c24e","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDU1ZmQ2ZjQ1NzdiYmFjM2M3NmE4MGMxZGYwOGQxN2IwN2MzOGMyNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/f2307c904060be90c9788dd322b27e72652a3d71","sha":"f2307c904060be90c9788dd322b27e72652a3d71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/f2307c904060be90c9788dd322b27e72652a3d71"}],"sha":"55fd6f4577bbac3c76a80c1df08d17b07c38c24e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/55fd6f4577bbac3c76a80c1df08d17b07c38c24e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/f2307c904060be90c9788dd322b27e72652a3d71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:12:22Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T10:12:22Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): paid-OCR data model + ingestability seam for sans_texte\n\nFoundation for transcribing digitized text with no BnF OCR layer\n(the `sans_texte` ingestion class) via paid Mistral OCR. No behaviour\nchange yet — nothing runs paid OCR.\n\n- Project gains paidOcrEnabled / paidOcrBudgetUsd / paidOcrSpentUsd;\n  IngestJob gains paidOcrArks / paidOcrEstimatedUsd / paidOcrActualUsd.\n- lib/constants: Mistral OCR batch pricing + per-doc page cap + default\n  budget ceiling.\n- estimatePaidOcrCostUsd(): pure page-count → USD estimate.\n- _partitionByIngestability gains an opt-in `paidOcr` mode that routes a\n  confident `sans_texte` doc to a third bucket instead of excluding it.\n  Default off, so every existing caller is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ae1a84c826a20213278ef709f7f3dcc67115a40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/5ae1a84c826a20213278ef709f7f3dcc67115a40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/f2307c904060be90c9788dd322b27e72652a3d71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/f2307c904060be90c9788dd322b27e72652a3d71","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGYyMzA3YzkwNDA2MGJlOTBjOTc4OGRkMzIyYjI3ZTcyNjUyYTNkNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/2a1c33fe4b09269ad9b9ac3f52c60a40b2358c3a","sha":"2a1c33fe4b09269ad9b9ac3f52c60a40b2358c3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/2a1c33fe4b09269ad9b9ac3f52c60a40b2358c3a"}],"sha":"f2307c904060be90c9788dd322b27e72652a3d71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/f2307c904060be90c9788dd322b27e72652a3d71"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/2a1c33fe4b09269ad9b9ac3f52c60a40b2358c3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T09:21:32Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T09:21:32Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"chore(bnf): release 0.6.1\n\nAuto-expanding chat composer (Enter-to-send, Shift+Enter newline).\nBumps app/worker/broker image tags + chart version in lock-step.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74b1225164cf04988cf9d260a7d2e1ff0fdfe101","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/74b1225164cf04988cf9d260a7d2e1ff0fdfe101"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/2a1c33fe4b09269ad9b9ac3f52c60a40b2358c3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/2a1c33fe4b09269ad9b9ac3f52c60a40b2358c3a","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDJhMWMzM2ZlNGIwOTI2OWFkOWI5YWMzZjUyYzYwYTQwYjIzNThjM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/2325f3421b4e8f630aa9bbf2f89d8846bce11e83","sha":"2325f3421b4e8f630aa9bbf2f89d8846bce11e83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/2325f3421b4e8f630aa9bbf2f89d8846bce11e83"}],"sha":"2a1c33fe4b09269ad9b9ac3f52c60a40b2358c3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/2a1c33fe4b09269ad9b9ac3f52c60a40b2358c3a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/2325f3421b4e8f630aa9bbf2f89d8846bce11e83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T09:14:35Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T09:14:35Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(bnf): auto-expanding chat composer with Enter-to-send\n\nReplace the single-line <Input> in the corpus/research composer with the\nauto-growing <Textarea> primitive (field-sizing-content): the box grows and\nwraps with the text, caps at max-h-40 then scrolls. Enter sends, Shift+Enter\ninserts a newline, and IME compositions are guarded so candidate selection\ndoesn''t submit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"322983000d35493d52e03648d421292ef58cfd81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/322983000d35493d52e03648d421292ef58cfd81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/2325f3421b4e8f630aa9bbf2f89d8846bce11e83","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/2325f3421b4e8f630aa9bbf2f89d8846bce11e83","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDIzMjVmMzQyMWI0ZThmNjMwYWE5YmJmMmY4OWQ4ODQ2YmNlMTFlODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/4468c549eebd7d91e91603b8658c93caad157525","sha":"4468c549eebd7d91e91603b8658c93caad157525","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/4468c549eebd7d91e91603b8658c93caad157525"}],"sha":"2325f3421b4e8f630aa9bbf2f89d8846bce11e83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/2325f3421b4e8f630aa9bbf2f89d8846bce11e83"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/4468c549eebd7d91e91603b8658c93caad157525/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T08:51:24Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T08:51:24Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"chore(bnf): release 0.6.0","tree":{"sha":"c353d3335379a170cd64121dae8f1003d4c30218","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/c353d3335379a170cd64121dae8f1003d4c30218"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/4468c549eebd7d91e91603b8658c93caad157525","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/4468c549eebd7d91e91603b8658c93caad157525","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDQ0NjhjNTQ5ZWViZDdkOTFlOTE2MDNiODY1OGM5M2NhYWQxNTc1MjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/71af82d011c1f50ed802250ea34bdda52d00f4d0","sha":"71af82d011c1f50ed802250ea34bdda52d00f4d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/71af82d011c1f50ed802250ea34bdda52d00f4d0"}],"sha":"4468c549eebd7d91e91603b8658c93caad157525","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/4468c549eebd7d91e91603b8658c93caad157525"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/71af82d011c1f50ed802250ea34bdda52d00f4d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T08:19:25Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T08:19:25Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"lots of work","tree":{"sha":"9c0f41ccee2fbda0cca7455c58c2fc070bc105ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/9c0f41ccee2fbda0cca7455c58c2fc070bc105ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/71af82d011c1f50ed802250ea34bdda52d00f4d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/71af82d011c1f50ed802250ea34bdda52d00f4d0","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDcxYWY4MmQwMTFjMWY1MGVkODAyMjUwZWEzNGJkZGE1MmQwMGY0ZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/edbeadcfaf434dec1a4025d4935665456ff99850","sha":"edbeadcfaf434dec1a4025d4935665456ff99850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/edbeadcfaf434dec1a4025d4935665456ff99850"}],"sha":"71af82d011c1f50ed802250ea34bdda52d00f4d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/71af82d011c1f50ed802250ea34bdda52d00f4d0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/edbeadcfaf434dec1a4025d4935665456ff99850/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T14:15:24Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T14:15:24Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): workspace health indicator + accurate tool-error status\n\nReplace the static \"MCP\" dot in the header with a live health indicator: lanes\ngo green/orange/red from a 5-minute aggregation of recent tool-call outcomes\n(backed by a new tool_call(created_at) index) plus a short-TTL MCP connectivity\nprobe, polled every 30s.\n\n- /api/health endpoint + HealthService (windowed tool-call rollup + cached MCP\n  initialize probe); header health-status component.\n- Persist the real tool status: a BnF-MCP soft failure relayed as a transport\n  success with a { success: false } envelope is now folded into the persisted\n  status (prisma adapter) and the streamed status (turn-stream), so the\n  indicator reflects actual failures instead of a false \"ok\".","tree":{"sha":"6eec35e0c347fab0534009889fbc31abb10f2322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/6eec35e0c347fab0534009889fbc31abb10f2322"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/edbeadcfaf434dec1a4025d4935665456ff99850","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/edbeadcfaf434dec1a4025d4935665456ff99850","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGVkYmVhZGNmYWY0MzRkZWMxYTQwMjVkNDkzNTY2NTQ1NmZmOTk4NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/7c6e1cf21f0219ce1dd9e13549617e1d7c4a4df8","sha":"7c6e1cf21f0219ce1dd9e13549617e1d7c4a4df8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/7c6e1cf21f0219ce1dd9e13549617e1d7c4a4df8"}],"sha":"edbeadcfaf434dec1a4025d4935665456ff99850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/edbeadcfaf434dec1a4025d4935665456ff99850"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/7c6e1cf21f0219ce1dd9e13549617e1d7c4a4df8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T14:15:09Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T14:15:09Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): librarian feedback on sessions, notes, and turns\n\nAdd a polymorphic feedback model (target = session | note | turn) with a\none-per-target unique key so a rating can be revised. Source of truth is our\nDB; id doubles as the future idempotent Langfuse score id and langfuseSessionId\nis the deferred offline join key — nothing is written to Langfuse at runtime.\n\n- Feedback model + migration; FeedbackService enforces target↔project integrity.\n- Feedback button + dialog (rating + optional comment); anchored on the session\n  header, each completed assistant turn (hover-revealed), and the note reader.","tree":{"sha":"76ac36e8dcf53117be84aa5024008dd44eb2588c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/76ac36e8dcf53117be84aa5024008dd44eb2588c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/7c6e1cf21f0219ce1dd9e13549617e1d7c4a4df8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/7c6e1cf21f0219ce1dd9e13549617e1d7c4a4df8","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDdjNmUxY2YyMWYwMjE5Y2UxZGQ5ZTEzNTQ5NjE3ZTFkN2M0YTRkZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/542021f0791a2bacaae280be8cfa3f9770e7860e","sha":"542021f0791a2bacaae280be8cfa3f9770e7860e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/542021f0791a2bacaae280be8cfa3f9770e7860e"}],"sha":"7c6e1cf21f0219ce1dd9e13549617e1d7c4a4df8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/7c6e1cf21f0219ce1dd9e13549617e1d7c4a4df8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/542021f0791a2bacaae280be8cfa3f9770e7860e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T14:14:48Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T14:14:48Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): corpus filter tools, bulk removal deltas, background canonicalizer\n\nThree related advances to corpus building, plus the worker-side execution of\ncorpus deltas.\n\n- Agent corpus tools: add corpus_list and corpus_remove_by_filter over a shared\n  metadata filter set (type/lang/source/ingest-class/year/free-text). Bulk\n  removal supports a dry-run preview (capped sample) before the amber commit;\n  the chat renders a dedicated remove-by-filter pill.\n- Corpus-delta removal: the worker now honors `removed` ARKs — removeEntry()\n  deletes the dataset entry (cascades MinIO/Qdrant/Meilisearch) and clearDocState()\n  drops the ingest-state row so a re-add re-indexes; removal-only deltas create a\n  parent job with no child doc-jobs and finalize once the deletes complete. The\n  blob cache is left in place so re-adding a removed doc skips the BnF round-trip.\n- Background cb→Gallica canonicalizer: corpus_add now returns instantly and\n  marks added catalogue notices `pending`; a detached drainer (kicked on add,\n  resumed at boot, swept periodically) upgrades each digitized notice to its\n  Gallica doc in a new version, bounded per pass per CLAUDE_ERROR_PATTERNS §14.\n- Job history shows version label (v10 → v15) and run duration; stage pipeline\n  reports a removed count.\n- Model selector: default to GLM 5.2 and keep the selector collapsed to a bare\n  icon until the user switches away from the default; server falls back to the\n  provider-appropriate default model.\n- Fold the BnF-MCP soft-failure envelope into tool error status (toolCallErrored)\n  so failed Gallica calls don''t read as \"ok\".","tree":{"sha":"ffc4de9f10aa488d3ecb5ab081202cf5894805ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/ffc4de9f10aa488d3ecb5ab081202cf5894805ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/542021f0791a2bacaae280be8cfa3f9770e7860e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/542021f0791a2bacaae280be8cfa3f9770e7860e","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDU0MjAyMWYwNzkxYTJiYWNhYWUyODBiZThjZmEzZjk3NzBlNzg2MGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/6d56597fb1f82ab03b83e2991d4e6f94aa29c53c","sha":"6d56597fb1f82ab03b83e2991d4e6f94aa29c53c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/6d56597fb1f82ab03b83e2991d4e6f94aa29c53c"}],"sha":"542021f0791a2bacaae280be8cfa3f9770e7860e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/542021f0791a2bacaae280be8cfa3f9770e7860e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/6d56597fb1f82ab03b83e2991d4e6f94aa29c53c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T14:14:25Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T14:14:25Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"chore(bnf): release 0.4.0 — deploy BnF broker + wire OpenRouter provider\n\nProductionize the BnF broker as the single egress chokepoint and switch the\nagent to the OpenRouter provider in prod.\n\n- helm: add broker Deployment (hard-pinned single replica), Service, and\n  ConfigMap; pull BNF_CLIENT_KEY/SECRET and OPENROUTER_API_KEY via the\n  ExternalSecret; set config.agentProvider=openrouter; bump chart + images to\n  0.4.0.\n- docker-compose: add the broker service (worker profile) and route worker BnF\n  egress through it in-network.\n- worker/.env.example: correct the partner IIIF base to openapiproext.bnf.fr.\n- deploy skill + package.json: bump to 0.4.0.","tree":{"sha":"6fe8905312944c4fa2657fe75b9cd6f5296eb1bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/6fe8905312944c4fa2657fe75b9cd6f5296eb1bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/6d56597fb1f82ab03b83e2991d4e6f94aa29c53c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/6d56597fb1f82ab03b83e2991d4e6f94aa29c53c","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDZkNTY1OTdmYjFmODJhYjAzYjgzZTI5OTFkNGU2Zjk0YWEyOWM1M2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/36ad97eaf0868d8674556f437c1bd990c500aea6","sha":"36ad97eaf0868d8674556f437c1bd990c500aea6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/36ad97eaf0868d8674556f437c1bd990c500aea6"}],"sha":"6d56597fb1f82ab03b83e2991d4e6f94aa29c53c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/6d56597fb1f82ab03b83e2991d4e6f94aa29c53c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/36ad97eaf0868d8674556f437c1bd990c500aea6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T14:14:16Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T14:14:16Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(broker): shed on rate-freeze, bound request bodies, harden token mint\n\nReliability and SSRF/DoS hardening for the single-replica BnF egress broker,\nplus a fix to the authenticated partner-API host.\n\n- rate: acquire() now takes a wait budget and sheds with RateWaitTimeoutError\n  (→ 429) instead of queueing behind a multi-minute 429/403 freeze; spin until\n  a whole token is actually available so the bucket never over-issues past the\n  BnF ceiling.\n- server: cap and time-bound request-body reads (413/408) so a malformed or\n  slow-loris request can''t grow memory or pin the connection.\n- token: negative-cache failed OAuth mints (cooldown) so a token-endpoint\n  outage isn''t met with a re-mint storm; invalidateToken() forces a fresh mint\n  when the upstream 401s an as-yet-unexpired bearer.\n- config: point apiBaseUrl at openapiproext.bnf.fr (the token''d partner host),\n  not openapi.bnf.fr (the anonymous-per-IP IIIF mirror with no quota\n  attribution); add captcha-403 backoff, acquire/body limits.\n- .env.example: document the host fix and the 12→40/min manifest cap raise.","tree":{"sha":"37f3273093d9f1694c08e6382f09af32cea10b67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/37f3273093d9f1694c08e6382f09af32cea10b67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/36ad97eaf0868d8674556f437c1bd990c500aea6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/36ad97eaf0868d8674556f437c1bd990c500aea6","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDM2YWQ5N2VhZjA4NjhkODY3NDU1NmY0MzdjMWJkOTkwYzUwMGFlYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/879f943f57047d2b3df2e94be803948cbbeaec1b","sha":"879f943f57047d2b3df2e94be803948cbbeaec1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/879f943f57047d2b3df2e94be803948cbbeaec1b"}],"sha":"36ad97eaf0868d8674556f437c1bd990c500aea6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/36ad97eaf0868d8674556f437c1bd990c500aea6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/879f943f57047d2b3df2e94be803948cbbeaec1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T09:10:02Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T09:10:02Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"API migration","tree":{"sha":"82ac843ca8225e268f851fb59e7b87ea6701be53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/82ac843ca8225e268f851fb59e7b87ea6701be53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/879f943f57047d2b3df2e94be803948cbbeaec1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/879f943f57047d2b3df2e94be803948cbbeaec1b","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDg3OWY5NDNmNTcwNDdkMmIzZGYyZTk0YmU4MDM5NDhjYmJlYWVjMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/df51013cbe914e65b8b4af72c2169339a37bba8c","sha":"df51013cbe914e65b8b4af72c2169339a37bba8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/df51013cbe914e65b8b4af72c2169339a37bba8c"}],"sha":"879f943f57047d2b3df2e94be803948cbbeaec1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/879f943f57047d2b3df2e94be803948cbbeaec1b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/df51013cbe914e65b8b4af72c2169339a37bba8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T21:17:53Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T21:17:53Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(bnf): make ask_user end the turn on every model (endsTurn)\n\nMark askUserTool as a terminal tool (endsTurn: true, @alien/chat-sdk >= 0.8) so\nthe runner stops the loop after it returns instead of re-invoking the model.\nPreviously ask_user only asked the model to stop via a soft note in its result:\nClaude obeyed, but other models over OpenRouter re-called it (duplicate,\nsuperseded choosers) or kept thinking and calling more tools. Termination is now\nrunner-enforced, identical across providers.","tree":{"sha":"3945f070a11135b3ba82881b418e2209eeb67747","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/3945f070a11135b3ba82881b418e2209eeb67747"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/df51013cbe914e65b8b4af72c2169339a37bba8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/df51013cbe914e65b8b4af72c2169339a37bba8c","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGRmNTEwMTNjYmU5MTRlNjViOGI0YWY3MmMyMTY5MzM5YTM3YmJhOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/e2ad9a2e643442316c741978b50ab5768ec9961a","sha":"e2ad9a2e643442316c741978b50ab5768ec9961a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/e2ad9a2e643442316c741978b50ab5768ec9961a"}],"sha":"df51013cbe914e65b8b4af72c2169339a37bba8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/df51013cbe914e65b8b4af72c2169339a37bba8c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/e2ad9a2e643442316c741978b50ab5768ec9961a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T21:17:46Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T21:17:46Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): plug models in via OpenRouter (provider toggle + model selector)\n\nRoute the agent through OpenRouter so the corpus and research loops can run on\nnon-Anthropic models with BnF tools and MCP intact.\n\nPhase 1 — env-toggled provider:\n- AGENT_PROVIDER (anthropic default | openrouter) + OPENROUTER_API_KEY, the key\n  required-when-openrouter via a boot-time superRefine (no defaulted secret).\n- chat handler derives provider/apiKey/siteUrl(APP_URL)/appName from env;\n  direct Anthropic stays the default and rollback path.\n- bumped @alien/chat-sdk to ^0.8.0.\n\nPhase 2 — per-request model selector:\n- AGENT_AVAILABLE_MODELS frontier allow-list (Claude Sonnet 4.6 default, GLM 5.2,\n  Gemini 3.5 Flash, Mistral Medium 3.5, Qwen3.7 Max, DeepSeek V4 Pro) + shadcn\n  Select; shown only under the openrouter provider, hidden under anthropic.\n- useTurnStream sends body.model only under openrouter (a namespaced id would be\n  rejected by the direct-Anthropic path); provider threaded from the server\n  pages into both the Constituer and Rechercher chat layouts.\n- model label keys added to messages/{fr,en}.json.","tree":{"sha":"6f8d8d6959ef4327d63c8065b60e984d1e0cfe1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/6f8d8d6959ef4327d63c8065b60e984d1e0cfe1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/e2ad9a2e643442316c741978b50ab5768ec9961a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/e2ad9a2e643442316c741978b50ab5768ec9961a","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGUyYWQ5YTJlNjQzNDQyMzE2Yzc0MTk3OGI1MGFiNTc2OGVjOTk2MWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/cad4e09c63133434f4ca7e0e8042be48be75b2f7","sha":"cad4e09c63133434f4ca7e0e8042be48be75b2f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/cad4e09c63133434f4ca7e0e8042be48be75b2f7"}],"sha":"e2ad9a2e643442316c741978b50ab5768ec9961a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/e2ad9a2e643442316c741978b50ab5768ec9961a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/cad4e09c63133434f4ca7e0e8042be48be75b2f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T08:02:05Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T08:02:05Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"Lots of work","tree":{"sha":"a37e2219ff9b7f1703e35d55e64ae144b2829def","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/a37e2219ff9b7f1703e35d55e64ae144b2829def"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/cad4e09c63133434f4ca7e0e8042be48be75b2f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/cad4e09c63133434f4ca7e0e8042be48be75b2f7","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGNhZDRlMDljNjMxMzM0MzRmNGNhN2UwZTgwNDJiZTQ4YmU3NWIyZjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/9e0ba9fa90fae2e5daffd9f01ff6732cd89ff95c","sha":"9e0ba9fa90fae2e5daffd9f01ff6732cd89ff95c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/9e0ba9fa90fae2e5daffd9f01ff6732cd89ff95c"}],"sha":"cad4e09c63133434f4ca7e0e8042be48be75b2f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/cad4e09c63133434f4ca7e0e8042be48be75b2f7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/9e0ba9fa90fae2e5daffd9f01ff6732cd89ff95c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:52:08Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:52:08Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"chore(helm): bump demo-openaire image to 0.1.21","tree":{"sha":"a4939230b070ecaf5830f2d978536865ab0cb48d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/a4939230b070ecaf5830f2d978536865ab0cb48d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/9e0ba9fa90fae2e5daffd9f01ff6732cd89ff95c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/9e0ba9fa90fae2e5daffd9f01ff6732cd89ff95c","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDllMGJhOWZhOTBmYWUyZTVkYWZmZDlmMDFmZjY3MzJjZDg5ZmY5NWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/c966c5f538b1578d3c04403d58b17f6a799e23dd","sha":"c966c5f538b1578d3c04403d58b17f6a799e23dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/c966c5f538b1578d3c04403d58b17f6a799e23dd"}],"sha":"9e0ba9fa90fae2e5daffd9f01ff6732cd89ff95c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/9e0ba9fa90fae2e5daffd9f01ff6732cd89ff95c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/c966c5f538b1578d3c04403d58b17f6a799e23dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:52:08Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:52:08Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(openaire): re-add Next-stripped basePath prefix in auth route handler\n\nNext.js 14 App Router strips the configured basePath (/openaire) from\nrequest.url before route handlers run, so better-auth (basePath\n/openaire/api/auth) saw /api/auth/* and 404''d every auth route. Wrap\ntoNextJsHandler to put the /openaire prefix back on the request URL before\nbetter-auth routes it — the same pattern the working alien-agents demo uses.\n\nbasePath stays /openaire/api/auth so the OAuth redirect_uri better-auth emits\ncarries the prefix; the wrapper only fixes inbound route matching.","tree":{"sha":"9d297c89246fac3e6e931693952735a382e4a5d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/9d297c89246fac3e6e931693952735a382e4a5d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/c966c5f538b1578d3c04403d58b17f6a799e23dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/c966c5f538b1578d3c04403d58b17f6a799e23dd","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGM5NjZjNWY1MzhiMTU3OGQzYzA0NDAzZDU4YjE3ZjZhNzk5ZTIzZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/e08d89380d70e39f8523cb61a99ae346858eec35","sha":"e08d89380d70e39f8523cb61a99ae346858eec35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/e08d89380d70e39f8523cb61a99ae346858eec35"}],"sha":"c966c5f538b1578d3c04403d58b17f6a799e23dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/c966c5f538b1578d3c04403d58b17f6a799e23dd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/e08d89380d70e39f8523cb61a99ae346858eec35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:43:15Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:43:15Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(openaire): inject NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH at runtime for auth router\n\nserver-side better-auth (lib/auth.ts) reads process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH\nat runtime to set its basePath to ${path}/api/auth. Next.js only bakes\nNEXT_PUBLIC_* into the client bundle + next.config at build time, so the\nroute handler saw an empty value and mounted the auth router at /api/auth\ninstead of /openaire/api/auth -> every /openaire/api/auth/* request 404''d.\n\nAdd NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH to the configmap (sourced from istio.path), matching\nthe working alien-agents demo which sets it to /agents at runtime.","tree":{"sha":"f7214f04cc64f7ea3a89144c93bcad6aa3457c2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/f7214f04cc64f7ea3a89144c93bcad6aa3457c2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/e08d89380d70e39f8523cb61a99ae346858eec35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/e08d89380d70e39f8523cb61a99ae346858eec35","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGUwOGQ4OTM4MGQ3MGUzOWY4NTIzY2I2MWE5OWFlMzQ2ODU4ZWVjMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/aa80a35bc67b1798e669ea57be7462668ce772da","sha":"aa80a35bc67b1798e669ea57be7462668ce772da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/aa80a35bc67b1798e669ea57be7462668ce772da"}],"sha":"e08d89380d70e39f8523cb61a99ae346858eec35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/e08d89380d70e39f8523cb61a99ae346858eec35"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/aa80a35bc67b1798e669ea57be7462668ce772da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:35:33Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:35:33Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"chore(helm): bump demo-openaire image to 0.1.20","tree":{"sha":"135de125691445629fcea8ff770a260f55115930","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/135de125691445629fcea8ff770a260f55115930"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/aa80a35bc67b1798e669ea57be7462668ce772da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/aa80a35bc67b1798e669ea57be7462668ce772da","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGFhODBhMzViYzY3YjE3OThlNjY5ZWE1N2JlNzQ2MjY2OGNlNzcyZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/0d6f1bcfe4869303aab7a8c14fe190ec6402c82b","sha":"0d6f1bcfe4869303aab7a8c14fe190ec6402c82b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/0d6f1bcfe4869303aab7a8c14fe190ec6402c82b"}],"sha":"aa80a35bc67b1798e669ea57be7462668ce772da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/aa80a35bc67b1798e669ea57be7462668ce772da"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/0d6f1bcfe4869303aab7a8c14fe190ec6402c82b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:35:33Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T12:35:33Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(openaire): correct Better Auth /openaire subpath routing and sign-in method\n\nSign-in 404''d at POST /openaire/api/auth/sign-in/social in prod. Two bugs:\n\n- betterAuth() never set basePath, so the router mounted at /api/auth\n  instead of /openaire/api/auth and no auth route matched under the\n  Next.js basePath. Add basePath: ${NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH}/api/auth\n  (mirrors the working alien-agents demo).\n- TopNavBar called signIn.social({provider}), but authentik is a\n  generic-OAuth provider (genericOAuth plugin), not a built-in social\n  provider. Use signIn.oauth2({providerId}) -> /sign-in/oauth2.\n\nRequires the prod betterAuthUrl override to be the bare origin\nhttps://demo.alien.club (no subpath), so better-auth appends basePath\ncorrectly and the OAuth redirect_uri is built on the right host.","tree":{"sha":"f2e13b403eb4157cfdad029347bc2843c0e01a2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/f2e13b403eb4157cfdad029347bc2843c0e01a2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/0d6f1bcfe4869303aab7a8c14fe190ec6402c82b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/0d6f1bcfe4869303aab7a8c14fe190ec6402c82b","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDBkNmYxYmNmZTQ4NjkzMDNhYWI3YThjMTRmZTE5MGVjNjQwMmM4MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/6dfc7eca7090dcf724f525e82ebbf5b48d7b38d0","sha":"6dfc7eca7090dcf724f525e82ebbf5b48d7b38d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/6dfc7eca7090dcf724f525e82ebbf5b48d7b38d0"}],"sha":"0d6f1bcfe4869303aab7a8c14fe190ec6402c82b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/0d6f1bcfe4869303aab7a8c14fe190ec6402c82b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/6dfc7eca7090dcf724f525e82ebbf5b48d7b38d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T09:11:43Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T09:11:43Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"wip","tree":{"sha":"1073374c7df5ba8e7907c1d7572cc47e7146378a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/1073374c7df5ba8e7907c1d7572cc47e7146378a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/6dfc7eca7090dcf724f525e82ebbf5b48d7b38d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/6dfc7eca7090dcf724f525e82ebbf5b48d7b38d0","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDZkZmM3ZWNhNzA5MGRjZjcyNGY1MjVlODJlYmJmNWI0OGQ3YjM4ZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/a9e4bfa54010838666756447f8ba607eb39b173e","sha":"a9e4bfa54010838666756447f8ba607eb39b173e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/a9e4bfa54010838666756447f8ba607eb39b173e"}],"sha":"6dfc7eca7090dcf724f525e82ebbf5b48d7b38d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/6dfc7eca7090dcf724f525e82ebbf5b48d7b38d0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/a9e4bfa54010838666756447f8ba607eb39b173e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T08:38:20Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T08:38:20Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(bnf): make corpus ingestion demo-reliable\n\nPrior app-triggered runs stalled and needed manual pg-boss nudging; a real\n205-doc run then surfaced that bulk Gallica access trips a sticky, IP-wide\nbot-block. This makes a run finish start to finish with no intervention and\nstops un-ingestable documents from entering the queue or silently corrupting\nthe version pointer.\n\nExclude non-ingestable docs at submission: IngestService.submit partitions the\nadded delta via classifyIngestion — catalogue notices (cb*), non-digitized and\ntext-less docs never enter the queue. Excluded ARKs are recorded on the job\n(new ingest_job.excluded_arks / excluded_count) for an honest count rather than\nsilently dropped. A digitized-but-unresolved doc is never dropped — its class\nis still provisional, so the worker decides.\n\nWorker fails fast on catalogue notices: getDocumentInfo classifies a cb* ARK as\npermanent not_digitized before any HTTP, so it skips in ~0ms instead of\nECONNRESET-retrying for ~an hour. New not_digitized skip reason.\n\nGallica politeness: WORKER_CONCURRENCY 8->4, IMAGE_CONCURRENCY 8->2, general\nlimiter 8->3 rps. The old settings got our egress IP bot-blocked (captcha 403\non every path) after ~54 docs. Retry backoff base raised to 60s (~32min span)\nto outlast a throttle window; parked docs now read as \"N en reprise\" via a new\nper-doc outcomes line (done / retrying / skipped / failed / excluded).\n\nCommit gating: advance project.ingestedVersionId ONLY on a fully-successful job.\nAny per-doc failure -> commitPartialFailure marks the job failed, records\nstats.errors[], leaves the pointer put — so failed docs are never silently\nmarked ingested. The worker''s terminal callback now emits per-doc errors[] so\nretryFailed works, wired to a \"Réessayer les documents échoués\" button in the\nIngérer client.","tree":{"sha":"1509e5b2b194caef0b3fa7df5290de058f10ea7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/1509e5b2b194caef0b3fa7df5290de058f10ea7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/a9e4bfa54010838666756447f8ba607eb39b173e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/a9e4bfa54010838666756447f8ba607eb39b173e","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGE5ZTRiZmE1NDAxMDgzODY2Njc1NjQ0N2Y4YmE2MDdlYjM5YjE3M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/d9bd092d95b41adc94eaee2524933c979099e59e","sha":"d9bd092d95b41adc94eaee2524933c979099e59e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/d9bd092d95b41adc94eaee2524933c979099e59e"}],"sha":"a9e4bfa54010838666756447f8ba607eb39b173e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/a9e4bfa54010838666756447f8ba607eb39b173e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/d9bd092d95b41adc94eaee2524933c979099e59e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T21:46:36Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T21:46:36Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): promote ingest worker into the repo + real ingest progress\n\nMove the async ingest worker out of the gitignored sandbox into a tracked\nworker/ (Docker build context + env_file repointed; app tsconfig excludes it so\nNext never compiles it). .env stays gitignored — only .env.example is tracked.\n\nThe worker is self-contained: direct Gallica HTTP client, the public viewer\nAJAX endpoint as the primary OCR source with the rate-limited ALTO endpoint as\nfallback, Holo2 vision over raw fetch (the OpenAI SDK is incompatible with\nScaleway — \"Premature close\") with a Gemini gemma-4-31b-it fallback, RunPod\nbge-m3 embeddings, and a pg-boss queue that indexes the delta into the data\ncluster. Cluster HTTP and Gallica calls are timeout- + retry-hardened.\n\nIngest progress now reflects real per-doc work: each of the four stage bars is\ncomputed from the worker''s per-doc counters (job.stats) rather than a single\nglobal stage, and the runner emits embedding/indexing transitions so the bars\nform a genuine staircase. Adds a live ETA (elapsed / completed x remaining) and\nfixes the legacy progress fraction that rendered as 0%.","tree":{"sha":"6db81b758f3f1bb36f66e7db9c296149fee87fe8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/6db81b758f3f1bb36f66e7db9c296149fee87fe8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/d9bd092d95b41adc94eaee2524933c979099e59e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/d9bd092d95b41adc94eaee2524933c979099e59e","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGQ5YmQwOTJkOTViNDFhZGM5NGVhZWUyNTI0OTMzYzk3OTA5OWU1OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/4ab555c606e4443df69c1a21c0df95d5f4b31a34","sha":"4ab555c606e4443df69c1a21c0df95d5f4b31a34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/4ab555c606e4443df69c1a21c0df95d5f4b31a34"}],"sha":"d9bd092d95b41adc94eaee2524933c979099e59e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/d9bd092d95b41adc94eaee2524933c979099e59e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/4ab555c606e4443df69c1a21c0df95d5f4b31a34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T21:31:16Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T21:31:16Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): wire Langfuse tracing via chat-sdk v0.5\n\nBump @alien/chat-sdk to 0.5.0, which ships built-in Langfuse tracing. BnF only\ndeclares config: optional LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY / LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY /\nLANGFUSE_BASE_URL (surfaced as optional vars in lib/env.ts + documented in\n.env.example). When set, every agent turn flows to Langfuse — trace per turn,\na generation per Claude call, a span per tool — grouped by session.\n\nThe messages route adds a `trace` resolver supplying the one identity the SDK\ncan''t infer: userId, plus scope tags and projectId/appSessionId metadata.\nAbsent keys → tracing is simply off; no behavior change.","tree":{"sha":"4d5f0a35efb537a5df687e1a589423aade1f5a4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/4d5f0a35efb537a5df687e1a589423aade1f5a4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/4ab555c606e4443df69c1a21c0df95d5f4b31a34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/4ab555c606e4443df69c1a21c0df95d5f4b31a34","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDRhYjU1NWM2MDZlNDQ0M2RmNjljMWEyMWMwZGY5NWQ1ZjRiMzFhMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/0d44bc0e5cd480c0c9fbd9801f2a516afbbc0158","sha":"0d44bc0e5cd480c0c9fbd9801f2a516afbbc0158","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/0d44bc0e5cd480c0c9fbd9801f2a516afbbc0158"}],"sha":"4ab555c606e4443df69c1a21c0df95d5f4b31a34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/4ab555c606e4443df69c1a21c0df95d5f4b31a34"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/0d44bc0e5cd480c0c9fbd9801f2a516afbbc0158/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:59:43Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:59:43Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): admin usage dashboard\n\nPer-project and per-tool usage breakdown (tokens in/out, messages, tool calls)\nwith CSV export on the admin usage screen, backed by the admin usage hook.","tree":{"sha":"dad6a5afd1cc049d673d9afbb4f6e4c5f959d8cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/dad6a5afd1cc049d673d9afbb4f6e4c5f959d8cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/0d44bc0e5cd480c0c9fbd9801f2a516afbbc0158","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/0d44bc0e5cd480c0c9fbd9801f2a516afbbc0158","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDBkNDRiYzBlNWNkNDgwYzBjOWZiZDk4MDFmMmE1MTZhZmJiYzAxNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/6a9a93ea1e568acabb790cb6052f2bfdd197100d","sha":"6a9a93ea1e568acabb790cb6052f2bfdd197100d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/6a9a93ea1e568acabb790cb6052f2bfdd197100d"}],"sha":"0d44bc0e5cd480c0c9fbd9801f2a516afbbc0158","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/0d44bc0e5cd480c0c9fbd9801f2a516afbbc0158"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/6a9a93ea1e568acabb790cb6052f2bfdd197100d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:59:28Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:59:28Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): research note versioning & carnet\n\nAdds the note versions endpoint and the note edit form, with citation-pill,\natelier, and carnet updates so notes can be edited and reviewed across versions\nin both the atelier and carnet views.","tree":{"sha":"f7898053978ba8271ed33021d99d8e70fe16ac77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/f7898053978ba8271ed33021d99d8e70fe16ac77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/6a9a93ea1e568acabb790cb6052f2bfdd197100d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/6a9a93ea1e568acabb790cb6052f2bfdd197100d","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDZhOWE5M2VhMWU1NjhhY2FiYjc5MGNiNjA1MmYyYmZkZDE5NzEwMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/42dd666d6fd1979f3c99888ad29882002b260adc","sha":"42dd666d6fd1979f3c99888ad29882002b260adc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/42dd666d6fd1979f3c99888ad29882002b260adc"}],"sha":"6a9a93ea1e568acabb790cb6052f2bfdd197100d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/6a9a93ea1e568acabb790cb6052f2bfdd197100d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/42dd666d6fd1979f3c99888ad29882002b260adc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:59:19Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:59:19Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): ingest failures, retry & completion UI\n\nAdds the completion and failures tiles, a retry-failed endpoint and service\nhook, and surfaces per-stage descriptions and failure counts in the stage\npipeline and summary on the ingérer screen.","tree":{"sha":"eba9fb2ccb797606526d69c9515b3f375eeee6f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/eba9fb2ccb797606526d69c9515b3f375eeee6f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/42dd666d6fd1979f3c99888ad29882002b260adc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/42dd666d6fd1979f3c99888ad29882002b260adc","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDQyZGQ2NjZkNmZkMTk3OWYzYzk5ODg4YWQyOTg4MjAwMmIyNjBhZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/14c203ae8c7ae125f8dc076e12efc0ac3215d974","sha":"14c203ae8c7ae125f8dc076e12efc0ac3215d974","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/14c203ae8c7ae125f8dc076e12efc0ac3215d974"}],"sha":"42dd666d6fd1979f3c99888ad29882002b260adc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/42dd666d6fd1979f3c99888ad29882002b260adc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/14c203ae8c7ae125f8dc076e12efc0ac3215d974/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:59:10Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:59:10Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): agent chat presentation — ask-user tool, tool badges, streaming markdown\n\nAdds the ask_user interaction tool (with its answer card and pending/answered\nstates), a mutation pill + reworked tool-call badge driven by a tool display\nregistry, the typewriter streaming-markdown renderer, and BnF knowledge in the\nagent prompts. Drops the bespoke corpus-event component now folded into the\ntool-call presentation.","tree":{"sha":"75e899d53f1cb19148c239b7042347ec6f31704d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/75e899d53f1cb19148c239b7042347ec6f31704d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/14c203ae8c7ae125f8dc076e12efc0ac3215d974","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/14c203ae8c7ae125f8dc076e12efc0ac3215d974","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDE0YzIwM2FlOGM3YWUxMjVmOGRjMDc2ZTEyZWZjMGFjMzIxNWQ5NzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/c69a68d95e6996abf4feb00b7e7d06b40dee66ff","sha":"c69a68d95e6996abf4feb00b7e7d06b40dee66ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/c69a68d95e6996abf4feb00b7e7d06b40dee66ff"}],"sha":"14c203ae8c7ae125f8dc076e12efc0ac3215d974","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/14c203ae8c7ae125f8dc076e12efc0ac3215d974"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/c69a68d95e6996abf4feb00b7e7d06b40dee66ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:58:59Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:58:59Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): auth screens shell & co-branding\n\nShared auth layout shell carrying the Alien×BnF brand panel, applied to the\nsign-in, sign-up, and forgot-password screens.","tree":{"sha":"b9097bb81b5f81fd4d37aac5b17dd9f6d850bf26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/b9097bb81b5f81fd4d37aac5b17dd9f6d850bf26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/c69a68d95e6996abf4feb00b7e7d06b40dee66ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/c69a68d95e6996abf4feb00b7e7d06b40dee66ff","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGM2OWE2OGQ5NWU2OTk2YWJmNGZlYjAwYjdlN2QwNmI0MGRlZTY2ZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/96f265a4187eb9d574a8d3e56ff0548eb781be31","sha":"96f265a4187eb9d574a8d3e56ff0548eb781be31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/96f265a4187eb9d574a8d3e56ff0548eb781be31"}],"sha":"c69a68d95e6996abf4feb00b7e7d06b40dee66ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/c69a68d95e6996abf4feb00b7e7d06b40dee66ff"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/96f265a4187eb9d574a8d3e56ff0548eb781be31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:58:51Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:58:51Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): guided onboarding intros for corpus & research steps\n\nPer-user, per-step onboarding model + GET/POST /api/onboarding, with the corpus\nand research intro dialogs that auto-open once and reopen via the \"?\" button\nwithout resetting the seen flag. Wires the intros into the constituer and\nrechercher screens.","tree":{"sha":"a4c4106e1e77ea5df4814405a240f731656c8126","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/a4c4106e1e77ea5df4814405a240f731656c8126"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/96f265a4187eb9d574a8d3e56ff0548eb781be31","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/96f265a4187eb9d574a8d3e56ff0548eb781be31","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDk2ZjI2NWE0MTg3ZWI5ZDU3NGE4ZDNlNTZmZjA1NDhlYjc4MWJlMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/110df99137bc870dbec0e430dd35f7517ea27405","sha":"110df99137bc870dbec0e430dd35f7517ea27405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/110df99137bc870dbec0e430dd35f7517ea27405"}],"sha":"96f265a4187eb9d574a8d3e56ff0548eb781be31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/96f265a4187eb9d574a8d3e56ff0548eb781be31"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/110df99137bc870dbec0e430dd35f7517ea27405/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:58:35Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:58:35Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): projects list, create dialog & workspace switcher\n\nAdds the projects index (client-rendered tiles with per-project stats and\ningested badge), the create-project form + dialog, the GET/POST /api/projects\nroute and project queries, and the workspace header switcher + step nav driven\nby ROUTES / WORKSPACE_STEPS.","tree":{"sha":"3861019191a15ac371f924649b44ae3bc5381b19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/3861019191a15ac371f924649b44ae3bc5381b19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/110df99137bc870dbec0e430dd35f7517ea27405","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/110df99137bc870dbec0e430dd35f7517ea27405","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDExMGRmOTkxMzdiYzg3MGRiZWMwZTQzMGRkMzVmNzUxN2VhMjc0MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/d6cc32af7ae2b51d019bd86f4acde23b953791ba","sha":"d6cc32af7ae2b51d019bd86f4acde23b953791ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/d6cc32af7ae2b51d019bd86f4acde23b953791ba"}],"sha":"110df99137bc870dbec0e430dd35f7517ea27405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/110df99137bc870dbec0e430dd35f7517ea27405"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/d6cc32af7ae2b51d019bd86f4acde23b953791ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:58:25Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:58:25Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): corpus comprehension panel — facet bars & numérisation card\n\nReplaces the facet chips with color-coded distribution bars (type / language /\nsource) keyed to the dataset palette, adds the numérisation & océrisation card\n(digitized / ingestable / OCR / vision buckets), and surfaces pending/failed\nresolution states in the summary, period histogram, document rows, and active\nfilters bar.","tree":{"sha":"e8f3947600dd32ed6206041430f2b533c31be037","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/e8f3947600dd32ed6206041430f2b533c31be037"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/d6cc32af7ae2b51d019bd86f4acde23b953791ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/d6cc32af7ae2b51d019bd86f4acde23b953791ba","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGQ2Y2MzMmFmN2FlMmI1MWQwMTliZDg2ZjRhY2RlMjNiOTUzNzkxYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/aa82008da9e16d19f9a990dfa832cd56bacc7857","sha":"aa82008da9e16d19f9a990dfa832cd56bacc7857","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/aa82008da9e16d19f9a990dfa832cd56bacc7857"}],"sha":"d6cc32af7ae2b51d019bd86f4acde23b953791ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/d6cc32af7ae2b51d019bd86f4acde23b953791ba"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/aa82008da9e16d19f9a990dfa832cd56bacc7857/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:58:17Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:58:17Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): background document metadata resolution with OCR & numérisation status\n\nFreshly-added ARKs are persisted as stub Document rows and resolved in the\nbackground — the Document table is the queue (resolve_status / resolve_attempts,\nbounded retries, boot resume in instrumentation). Resolution fetches\ngallica.bnf.fr / catalogue.bnf.fr directly (IPv4-pinned, browser UA) to avoid\nthe flaky MCP Gallica hop, and records ocr_available so classifyIngestion() can\nbucket documents by digitization / OCR / ingestability. The corpus snapshot is\nresolve-aware (pending/failed counts) and the comprehension panel polls while\ndocuments are still resolving. Adds fast-xml-parser for the direct client.","tree":{"sha":"34efb2b0646c5cbeb790e6e06e184331e9ff004d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/34efb2b0646c5cbeb790e6e06e184331e9ff004d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/aa82008da9e16d19f9a990dfa832cd56bacc7857","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/aa82008da9e16d19f9a990dfa832cd56bacc7857","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGFhODIwMDhkYTllMTZkMTlmOWE5OTBkZmE4MzJjZDU2YmFjYzc4NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/8f6b8cc2b612484862fbfff301d3a5df5d38de03","sha":"8f6b8cc2b612484862fbfff301d3a5df5d38de03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/8f6b8cc2b612484862fbfff301d3a5df5d38de03"}],"sha":"aa82008da9e16d19f9a990dfa832cd56bacc7857","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/aa82008da9e16d19f9a990dfa832cd56bacc7857"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/8f6b8cc2b612484862fbfff301d3a5df5d38de03/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:58:01Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T19:58:01Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"chore(bnf): shared i18n strings, constants, design tokens & UI primitives\n\nFoundation for the workspace build-out: route table and layout/facet/MCP/\nresolve constants, prototype animation + mono-eyebrow utilities, Alien×BnF\nbrand assets, the toast primitive + provider wiring, and the shared stat /\nempty-state components. French and English message catalogs updated together\nso every subsequent feature commit resolves its i18n keys.","tree":{"sha":"93143c186f43960977bd1f92538865c5354a8392","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/93143c186f43960977bd1f92538865c5354a8392"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/8f6b8cc2b612484862fbfff301d3a5df5d38de03","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/8f6b8cc2b612484862fbfff301d3a5df5d38de03","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDhmNmI4Y2MyYjYxMjQ4NDg2MmZiZmZmMzAxZDNhNWRmNWQzOGRlMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/248c8c0bb4cdd7ad0e57d26a53aa60deec4eddda","sha":"248c8c0bb4cdd7ad0e57d26a53aa60deec4eddda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/248c8c0bb4cdd7ad0e57d26a53aa60deec4eddda"}],"sha":"8f6b8cc2b612484862fbfff301d3a5df5d38de03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/8f6b8cc2b612484862fbfff301d3a5df5d38de03"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/248c8c0bb4cdd7ad0e57d26a53aa60deec4eddda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T11:43:31Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T11:43:31Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): render corpus chat through SDK ChatPanel (drop hand-rolled chat UI)\n\nchat.tsx now renders via @alien/chat-sdk''s <ChatPanel chat={stream.chat}>,\ninjecting BnF''s design through the new render slots: header (title +\nconnected badge), renderAvatar (Alien glyph), renderUser (bubble),\nrenderText (StreamingMarkdown), renderTool (BadgeToolCall), renderDomainEvent\n(corpus/memory/ingest event rows), renderTyping (teal dots), composer\n(search-style input). No bespoke message/turn loop left.\n\n- turn-stream.ts: expose the underlying useChat handle (.chat) for ChatPanel;\n  enable the SDK smoother (StreamingMarkdown now renders streaming=false)\n- layout.tsx: import @alien/chat-sdk/react/styles.css before globals.css so\n  the existing ''BnF palette bridge'' (--chat-sdk-* overrides) wins the cascade\n\nVerified: tsc 0 errors, lint clean, next build OK. Visual pass pending live run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f6170309065e1b7ffdb84ff59548cbe7895a0ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/2f6170309065e1b7ffdb84ff59548cbe7895a0ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/248c8c0bb4cdd7ad0e57d26a53aa60deec4eddda","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/248c8c0bb4cdd7ad0e57d26a53aa60deec4eddda","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDI0OGM4YzBiYjRjZGQ3YWQwZTU3ZDI2YTUzYWE2MGRlZWM0ZWRkZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/38f2a3b80a9f0af95b604d997b9831eed8e43172","sha":"38f2a3b80a9f0af95b604d997b9831eed8e43172","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/38f2a3b80a9f0af95b604d997b9831eed8e43172"}],"sha":"248c8c0bb4cdd7ad0e57d26a53aa60deec4eddda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/248c8c0bb4cdd7ad0e57d26a53aa60deec4eddda"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/38f2a3b80a9f0af95b604d997b9831eed8e43172/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T11:25:49Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T11:25:49Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): migrate agent chat to chat-sdk v0.4 runtime; delete bespoke layer\n\nReplaces the hand-rolled detached runtime + custom SSE with the SDK''s\ndurable TurnRuntime + Prisma adapter, behind one route.\n\n- app/api/sessions/[sid]/messages/route.ts: durable {POST,GET,DELETE} via\n  createChatHandler({ persistence, claude:{ system, buildTools, buildToolContext }})\n  wrapped in withAuth+bouncer; DELETE cancels via handler.runtime\n- tools: ctx.pubsub.publish(turnId,…) -> ctx.emit?.(…) (corpus/memory/ingest/note)\n- registry-factory: TurnScopedCtx drops pubsub/turnId/turnMessageId; runtime\n  injects signal+emit; buildTurnScopedRegistry(signal) builds per-turn MCP session\n- hooks/api/turn-stream.ts: now a thin adapter over useChat({resume}) preserving\n  the UseTurnStreamResult shape (UI components unchanged)\n- AgentService slimmed to buildSystemPrompt; reaper slimmed to a registry-free\n  boot-time orphan sweep (run once from instrumentation.ts)\n- DELETE bespoke runtime: runner/pubsub/registry/finalize/detached-signal/\n  persistence/types/history + old /turn and /stream routes\n- consume SDK via local 0.4.0 tarball (publish pending)\n\nVerified: tsc 0 errors, lint clean, next build OK, smoke 10/10.\nLive agent E2E (stream/chip/reattach/cancel) pending manual run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5f501e426b0f8cceb836d80180ea01e13ea880e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/5f501e426b0f8cceb836d80180ea01e13ea880e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/38f2a3b80a9f0af95b604d997b9831eed8e43172","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/38f2a3b80a9f0af95b604d997b9831eed8e43172","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDM4ZjJhM2I4MGE5ZjBhZjk1YjYwNGQ5OTdiOTgzMWVlZDhlNDMxNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/653b50b3038fe2005d7477f969db9d104d4202ac","sha":"653b50b3038fe2005d7477f969db9d104d4202ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/653b50b3038fe2005d7477f969db9d104d4202ac"}],"sha":"38f2a3b80a9f0af95b604d997b9831eed8e43172","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/38f2a3b80a9f0af95b604d997b9831eed8e43172"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/653b50b3038fe2005d7477f969db9d104d4202ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-19T11:03:58Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T11:03:58Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): Prisma chat persistence adapter conforming to SDK v0.4 contract\n\nImplements @alien/chat-sdk/persistence ChatPersistenceAdapter against the\nexisting AppSession/Message/ToolCall schema:\n- beginTurn: user+assistant Message rows + activeMessageId guard (mirrors\n  AgentService.startTurn)\n- appendContent/recordToolStart/recordToolEnd/endTurn/failTurn/cancelTurn\n- getActiveTurn + loadSnapshot (via AgentQueries.listMessagesAndToolCalls,\n  mapped to ServerSnapshot)\n- recordDomainEvent intentionally omitted (BnF derives domain state)\n\nPoint BnF at the local v0.4 build (file:../../tooling/chat-sdk). Verified\nwith a begin->append->tool->end round-trip against the dev Postgres\n(loadSnapshot + getActiveTurn assertions, rows cleaned up).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"879f73184197b1809be4108bfce29d8e0effcf92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/879f73184197b1809be4108bfce29d8e0effcf92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/653b50b3038fe2005d7477f969db9d104d4202ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/653b50b3038fe2005d7477f969db9d104d4202ac","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDY1M2I1MGIzMDM4ZmUyMDA1ZDc0NzdmOTY5ZGI5ZDEwNGQ0MjAyYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/78472eed352641934e2b1c6f30f6a407339806e3","sha":"78472eed352641934e2b1c6f30f6a407339806e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/78472eed352641934e2b1c6f30f6a407339806e3"}],"sha":"653b50b3038fe2005d7477f969db9d104d4202ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/653b50b3038fe2005d7477f969db9d104d4202ac"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/78472eed352641934e2b1c6f30f6a407339806e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T18:03:01Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T18:03:01Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"fix(bnf): escape comment containing *​/ in globals.css\n\nPath `alien-intelligence-design-system-*​/tokens/` closed the CSS\ncomment prematurely; replaced with `{hash}/tokens/`. PostCSS now\nparses the file. Build green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"657c22d583ab2a32689547b1a04d373d8f84a5ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/657c22d583ab2a32689547b1a04d373d8f84a5ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/78472eed352641934e2b1c6f30f6a407339806e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/78472eed352641934e2b1c6f30f6a407339806e3","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDc4NDcyZWVkMzUyNjQxOTM0ZTJiMWM2ZjMwZjZhNDA3MzM5ODA2ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/b70be072431baee870047da57a97bfa5e214d668","sha":"b70be072431baee870047da57a97bfa5e214d668","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/b70be072431baee870047da57a97bfa5e214d668"}],"sha":"78472eed352641934e2b1c6f30f6a407339806e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/78472eed352641934e2b1c6f30f6a407339806e3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/b70be072431baee870047da57a97bfa5e214d668/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T17:49:59Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T17:49:59Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): wire Alien × BnF design system tokens; dark-first\n\nPhase A of slice-5.5 (design-fidelity). Tokens extracted verbatim from\ndesign/_ds/alien-intelligence-design-system-*/tokens/{colors,spacing,\ntypography}.css. The previous globals.css was the shadcn default with\na 2-var chat-sdk override; this rewrite makes the app actually look\nlike the Claude design HTML.\n\n- :root + .dark exposes the full DS palette: --neutral-50..950,\n  --teal-50..950 + --brand-teal/--brand-teal-soft, --dataset-1..7\n  (per-category colors used by doctype badges + facet bars +\n  histogram), semantic (--info/--success/--warning/--destructive),\n  --sidebar-* set\n- Tailwind v4 @theme: maps the DS values onto Tailwind utilities\n  (bg-dataset-1 etc.)\n- shadcn vars (--background, --card, --primary, --border, --ring, …)\n  mapped to DS tokens so all 13 primitives + form + textarea pick up\n  the dark palette without component-level changes\n- Typography: --font-sans / --font-mono / --font-display + weight/\n  size/leading/tracking scales\n- Spacing + radii + shadows tokens\n- app/[locale]/layout.tsx sets className=\"dark\" on <html> (dark-first)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f6289e0f73f11a3561f6687a94f41ae86ac9373","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/1f6289e0f73f11a3561f6687a94f41ae86ac9373"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/b70be072431baee870047da57a97bfa5e214d668","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/b70be072431baee870047da57a97bfa5e214d668","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGI3MGJlMDcyNDMxYmFlZTg3MDA0N2RhNTdhOTdiZmE1ZTIxNGQ2Njg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/c787211d34cb216ec3201cdce8d128a4df0447b0","sha":"c787211d34cb216ec3201cdce8d128a4df0447b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/c787211d34cb216ec3201cdce8d128a4df0447b0"}],"sha":"b70be072431baee870047da57a97bfa5e214d668","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/b70be072431baee870047da57a97bfa5e214d668"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/c787211d34cb216ec3201cdce8d128a4df0447b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T17:49:45Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T17:49:45Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): slice-6 partial — memory edit, ingest retry, /admin/usage, textarea\n\nSalvages work that landed before the design-fidelity pivot. Phase 2+ of\nslice 6 (full feature wiring + UI) lands after the design pass.\n\nMemory user-edit (model + REST + hooks):\n- MemoryService.createUserItem (alias of write with origin=user),\n  update(text/section), reorder(position)\n- POST /api/projects/[id]/memory (user-create), PUT (edit), PATCH (reorder)\n- hooks: useCreateMemoryItem, useUpdateMemoryItem, useReorderMemoryItem\n\nNote versions (preview):\n- NoteQueries.listVersions; NoteVersion re-exported in schema\n\nIngest retry (service hook):\n- IngestService.retryFailed reads stats.errors, submits new job for the\n  failed ARK subset\n- hooks/api/ingest: useRetryFailedIngest\n\nAdmin observability:\n- lib/auth-helpers: requireAdminUser (notFound for non-admin)\n- /api/admin/usage GET (token totals + tool frequency, last 7 days)\n- /api/admin/usage/export GET (CSV download)\n- /[locale]/admin/usage page + client (skeleton/error/content)\n\nshadcn Textarea primitive (was missing; used by notes edit form).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a76ff92718514ee646bc9858321fe8c31c60a13a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/a76ff92718514ee646bc9858321fe8c31c60a13a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/c787211d34cb216ec3201cdce8d128a4df0447b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/c787211d34cb216ec3201cdce8d128a4df0447b0","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGM3ODcyMTFkMzRjYjIxNmVjMzIwMWNkY2U4ZDEyOGE0ZGYwNDQ3YjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/f698675e51ec0ce30e1bcd5ceb4181e241fe45b7","sha":"f698675e51ec0ce30e1bcd5ceb4181e241fe45b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/f698675e51ec0ce30e1bcd5ceb4181e241fe45b7"}],"sha":"c787211d34cb216ec3201cdce8d128a4df0447b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/c787211d34cb216ec3201cdce8d128a4df0447b0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/f698675e51ec0ce30e1bcd5ceb4181e241fe45b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T17:23:41Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T17:23:41Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"chore(bnf): migrate onboarding_and_sso\n\n- User.alienUserId String? @unique — links the better-auth User row to\n  the Alien Authentik OIDC sub when slice-6 SSO is wired\n- UserOnboardingSeen { userId, intro, seenAt } composite PK\n  ON DELETE CASCADE — drives the once-per-(user,intro) onboarding\n  dialog auto-open logic\n\nSmoke 10/10.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cce9db9939554824f19aa9c2c61fed4f8fcab5a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/cce9db9939554824f19aa9c2c61fed4f8fcab5a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/f698675e51ec0ce30e1bcd5ceb4181e241fe45b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/f698675e51ec0ce30e1bcd5ceb4181e241fe45b7","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGY2OTg2NzVlNTFlYzBjZTMwZTFiY2Q1Y2ViNDE4MWUyNDFmZTQ1Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/76eeba1e1b2326409adb2bb43086965dce8534ea","sha":"76eeba1e1b2326409adb2bb43086965dce8534ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/76eeba1e1b2326409adb2bb43086965dce8534ea"}],"sha":"f698675e51ec0ce30e1bcd5ceb4181e241fe45b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/f698675e51ec0ce30e1bcd5ceb4181e241fe45b7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/76eeba1e1b2326409adb2bb43086965dce8534ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T17:21:21Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T17:21:21Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"test(bnf): 10th smoke check — note citations parsed + persisted\n\nNoteService.create with a body containing 2 [[ark|label|folio]]\nreferences writes Note.citationCount=2 and matching Citation rows.\nCleanup deletes Citation → NoteVersion → Note → project rows.\n\n`npm run smoke` now 10/10.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d0bf761a973489fc5a1a4b5152284bf100b4cb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/9d0bf761a973489fc5a1a4b5152284bf100b4cb2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/76eeba1e1b2326409adb2bb43086965dce8534ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/76eeba1e1b2326409adb2bb43086965dce8534ea","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDc2ZWViYTFlMWIyMzI2NDA5YWRiMmJiNDMwODY5NjVkY2U4NTM0ZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/8a89509ec2c38317bf3689514fb1afbdd123c201","sha":"8a89509ec2c38317bf3689514fb1afbdd123c201","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/8a89509ec2c38317bf3689514fb1afbdd123c201"}],"sha":"76eeba1e1b2326409adb2bb43086965dce8534ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/76eeba1e1b2326409adb2bb43086965dce8534ea"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/8a89509ec2c38317bf3689514fb1afbdd123c201/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T17:16:58Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T17:16:58Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): Rechercher (Atelier + Carnet + IIIF panel + citations UI)\n\nAtelier:\n- LayoutAtelier 40/60 (chat | notes tabs + \"+\" new note)\n- CardNoteTab: useNote(id), 3-state UI, NoteBody renderer\n- NoteBody: tokenizeMarkdown interleaves text segments (react-markdown +\n  remark-gfm + rehype-sanitize) with <CitationPill>\n- DialogNewNote: react-hook-form + Zod, title-only (agent fills body\n  via note_update later)\n- /rechercher page (server): auth + project guard, ensureDefaultForScope\n  \"research\" session, listForProject notes. Client gates on\n  ingestedVersionId → \"lancez l''ingestion d''abord\" card when not ready.\n\nCarnet:\n- /rechercher/carnet page (server) loads all notes with citations\n- LayoutCarnet: w-64 TOC sidebar + scrollable journal entries +\n  \"Exporter en Markdown\" Blob download\n- CarnetEntry: title + French date stamp + NoteBody\n\nIIIF panel:\n- SheetCitationSource (Sheet right, w-[480px]): IIIF image (1200,),\n  ARK monospace, 3 external links (Gallica item / IIIF manifest), +\n  \"Citations dans ce projet\" list from useCitationsForArk when >1.\n\nnext.config.ts: gallica.bnf.fr added to images.remotePatterns.\ni18n: 19 keys (research.* + citations.panel.*). fr/en parity.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"39b6348d6bc1c4b5f27c77b8c881fe3eefcfe96c","u