ries projectId in mutation vars so both caches invalidate correctly.\n\nhooks/api/citations: useCitationsForArk(projectId, ark | null).\n\nreact-markdown + remark-gfm + rehype-sanitize added (used by note\nrendering in the next commit).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f1bfc21f6a0e2d0391b3e565f59f5933bcb4775f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/f1bfc21f6a0e2d0391b3e565f59f5933bcb4775f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/b31baa7699e554af33d02b3f3c9a666480c42c01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/b31baa7699e554af33d02b3f3c9a666480c42c01","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKGIzMWJhYTc2OTllNTU0YWYzM2QwMmIzZjNjOWE2NjY0ODBjNDJjMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/94d65f76e7a05496e69b4cfab3d76ac4caae0d3a","sha":"94d65f76e7a05496e69b4cfab3d76ac4caae0d3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/94d65f76e7a05496e69b4cfab3d76ac4caae0d3a"}],"sha":"b31baa7699e554af33d02b3f3c9a666480c42c01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/b31baa7699e554af33d02b3f3c9a666480c42c01"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/94d65f76e7a05496e69b4cfab3d76ac4caae0d3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T16:48:42Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T16:48:42Z","email":"leo@jogl.io","name":"Leo"},"message":"feat(bnf): research agent tools + research prompt\n\n- lib/agent/tools/rag.ts: rag_query (gated on ingestedVersionId; returns\n  passages or error message in French when not ingested yet)\n- lib/agent/tools/note.ts: note_list, note_get, note_create, note_update\n  — create/update publish note_event{kind:created|updated, noteId, title}\n- lib/agent/tools/doc.ts: doc_get — projectId+ark composite key lookup\n- AGENT_TOOLS adds 6 new entries (ragQuery + 4 note tools + docGet);\n  appTools array extended\n- lib/agent/prompts/research.ts: real prompt per design doc 08 — French,\n  cite-everything, [[ark|label|folio]] syntax, prefer note_update over\n  note_create when related, scoped memory writes\n- lib/agent/prompts/builder.ts: render() dispatches by session.scope;\n  research path passes ingest status to renderResearchPrompt;\n  loadIngestStatus helper added\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"041aac90502faa920048fa2ffb2f39a51067a476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/trees/041aac90502faa920048fa2ffb2f39a51067a476"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/git/commits/94d65f76e7a05496e69b4cfab3d76ac4caae0d3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/94d65f76e7a05496e69b4cfab3d76ac4caae0d3a","node_id":"C_kwDOQGRPJdoAKDk0ZDY1Zjc2ZTdhMDU0OTZlNjliNGNmYWIzZDc2YWM0Y2FhZTBkM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commit/ac7c764d4a67bb85258d7458535e05c8ed3cccef","sha":"ac7c764d4a67bb85258d7458535e05c8ed3cccef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/ac7c764d4a67bb85258d7458535e05c8ed3cccef"}],"sha":"94d65f76e7a05496e69b4cfab3d76ac4caae0d3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/94d65f76e7a05496e69b4cfab3d76ac4caae0d3a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-alien-club/datastreaming-demos/commits/ac7c764d4a67bb85258d7458535e05c8ed3cccef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T16:48:30Z","ema